<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- WOL</book>
  <para style="h">Màrk</para>
  <para style="toc1">Xibaaru jàmm bu Almasi Yeesu, ci jottalib Màrk</para>
  <para style="toc2">Màrk</para>
  <para style="toc3">Marc</para>
  <para style="mt2">Xibaaru jàmm bu Almasi Yeesu,</para>
  <para style="mt2">ci jottalib</para>
  <para style="mt1">Màrk</para>
  <para style="ip">Màrk taalibeb Piyeer la, te Piyeer bokk na ci taalibe yi gëna jege Yeesu (<char style="bk">1.Piyeer</char> 5.13). Màrk xam na it njàngaleem ndawal Yeesu li tudd Póol (<char style="bk">Filemon</char> 24; <char style="bk">2.Timote</char> 4.11). Yaayu Màrk, Yerusalem la dëkk (<char style="bk">Jëf ya</char> 12.12).</para>
  <para style="ip">Fanweeri at gannaaw bi Yeesu deewee, la Màrk bind téereem, ngir tontu laaj bii: kan mooy Yeesu? Day wone kéemaan yi Yeesu def ak sañ-sañam ci ngelaw li ak ci géej gi sax. Li gëna fés ci nettali bi mooy bi Piyeer di wax Yeesu, naan ko: «Yaa di Almasi bi» (8.29). Gannaaw loolu, Yeesu tegu ci yoonu Yerusalem fi mu xame ne foofa la wara deewee. Coonoom ak deewam ñooy wone li waral mu nekk Almasi bi: «Ñëwul ngir ñu di ko surgawu, waaye mu nekk surga, ba far joxe bakkanam, def ko njotug ñu bare» (10.45).</para>
  <para style="im">Ci tënk:</para>
  <para style="ili">1.1-13 Yaxya soob na Yeesu ci ndox, Seytaane di ko jéema fiir.</para>
  <para style="ili">1.14—9.50 Yeesu wone na gëddëm ci jàngaleem, ci kéemaan yi mu def.</para>
  <para style="ili">10.1-52 Yeesu tukki na Yerusalem.</para>
  <para style="ili">11.1—15.47 Ayu bés bu mujj bu Yeesu.</para>
  <para style="ili">16.1-20 Yeesu dekki na, feeñu na ay taalibeem.</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s1">Yaxya waare na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Lii mooy ndoortel xibaaru jàmm bu Yeesu <char style="w" lemma="Almasi b-:">Almasi</char> bi, <char style="w" lemma="Doomu Yàlla j-:">Doomu Yàlla</char> ji<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yàlla ci boppam moo woowe Yeesu doomam. Seetal ci aaya 11.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Mu doore ni ñu ko binde ci téereb Yonent Yàlla <char style="w" lemma="Esayi:">Esayi</char>, fu Yàlla ne:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">«Maa ngii di yebal sama ndaw, mu jiitu la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">xàllal la saw yoon<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Malasi</char> 3.1.</note>.<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />Baatu nit a ngi xaacoo ca màndiŋ ma, naan:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">“Nangeen xàll yoonu Boroom bi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">juballeen ay xàllam<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Esayi</char> 40.3.</note>.”»<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Yaxya:">Yaxya</char> nag dikk ca màndiŋ ma, di waare lu jëm ci tuubeel gu nit ñi wara fésale ag sóobu cim ndox, ngir Yàlla jéggal leen seeni bàkkaar. <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Ci kaw loolu mboolem diiwaanu Yude ak waa Yerusalem ñépp bàbbeeku, jëm ca Yaxya. Ñu tudd seeni bàkkaar, Yaxya sóob leen ca dexu Yurdan. <verse eid="MRK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Yaxyaa nga sol mbubb mu ñu ràbbe kawaru giléem, laxasoo laxasaayu der ca ndigg la, di dundey njéeréer ak lemu àll. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Mu waare, ne: «Am na ku ma sut kuy ñëw sama gannaaw, kooku, buumi caraxam sax yeyoowumaa sëgg, di ko ko feccil. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Man cim ndox laa leen sóob, waaye moom de, ci <char style="w" lemma="Noo gu Sell g-:">Noo gu Sell</char> gi la leen di sóob.»<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yaxya sóob na Yeesu ca dexu Yurdan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Ca fan yooyu la Yeesu bàyyikoo dëkk ba ñuy wax Nasaret ca diiwaanu Galile. Mu dikk, <char style="w" lemma="Yaxya:">Yaxya</char> sóob ko ca dexu Yurdan. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Naka la Yeesu génn ndox ma ca saa sa, daldi gis asamaan xar, <char style="w" lemma="Noo gu Sell g-:">Noowug Yàlla</char>, wàcc ni am pitax, ca kawam, <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />baat jibe asamaan, ne: «Yaa di sama Doom, sama soppe; yaw laay bànneexoo.»<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu dékku na fiiri Seytaane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Ca saa sa <char style="w" lemma="Noo gu Sell g-:">Noowug Yàlla</char> jañax Yeesu, ba ca biir màndiŋ ma. <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />Nekk na ca màndiŋ ma ñeent fukki fan, <char style="w" lemma="Seytaane:">Seytaane</char> di ko fiir, mu nekkandook rabi àll yi, malaaka yi di ko toppatoo.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesoo ngi waare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Gannaaw ba ñu tëjee <char style="w" lemma="Yaxya:">Yaxya</char> kaso, Yeesu dem Galile, di waare xibaaru jàmm bu Yàlla bi, <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />naan: «Waxtu wa mat na, nguurug Yàlla dëgmal na. Tuubleen seeni bàkkaar te gëm xibaaru jàmm bii.»<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu tànn na ñeenti taalibe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Yeesoo doon jaare tàkkal dexu Galile, daldi gis ku ñuy wax Simoŋ ak Àndre, rakkam ju mu bokkal ndey ak baay. Ña ngay mbaal ca dex ga, ndax ay nappkat lañu woon. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Yeesu ne leen: «Ñëwleen topp ma, ma def leen nappkati nit.» <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Ñu won mbaal ya gannaaw ca saa sa, daldi topp ca moom.<verse eid="MRK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Yeesu doxaat tuuti, gis Yanqóoba doomu Sebede ak Yowaan mi Yanqóoba bokkal ndey ak baay. Ña nga ca gaal ga, di gaar seeni mbaal. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Yeesu woo leen ca saa sa, ñu bàyyi seen baay Sebede ca gaal ga, mook surga ya, daldi topp ca moom.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu tàmbali naa wone gëddëm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Gannaaw loolu Yeesu ak taalibe ya jàll biir dëkk ba ñuy wax Kapernawum. Naka la <char style="w" lemma="bésub Noflaay b-:">bésub Noflaay</char> taxaw, Yeesu daldi dugg ca biir jàngub Yawut ba, di jàngale. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Ñu yéemu ca njàngaleem ndax sañ-sañ ba mu leen di jàngale niroowul ak na la firikati yoonu Musaa yay jàngalee.<verse eid="MRK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Jenn waay a nga woon ca seen biir jàngu ba, <char style="w" lemma="rab:">rab</char> a ko jàpp. Mu jekki di xaacu, naan: <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />«Yaw Yeesum Nasaret, ana lu nu joteek yaw? Alagsi nu mooy say tànk? Xam naa yaa di kan, yaa di <char style="w" lemma="Aji Sell j-:">Aji Sell</char> ju Yàlla ji.» <verse eid="MRK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Yeesu nag gëdd ko, ne ko: «Noppil te génn nit ki!» <verse eid="MRK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Rab wu bon wa daane waa ja ba muy say, mu yuuxu yuux gu réy, doora génne ca waa ja.<verse eid="MRK 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Ba loolu amee ñépp yéemu, naan ca seen biir: «Lii lu mu doon? Guléet mii njàngale! Céy bii xam-xam bu ànd ak sañ-sañ! Rab yi sax, mu jox leen ndigal, ñu def!» <verse eid="MRK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Turu Yeesu nag law a law ca saa sa, ba dajal diiwaanu Galile gépp.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu faj na jarag yu bare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Gannaaw ba Yeesu ak Yanqóoba ak Yowaan génnee ca jàngu ba, dañoo ànd ca saa sa, dem kër Simoŋ ak Àndre. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Fekk yaayu jabaru Simoŋ tëdd ndax yaram wu tàng. Ñu yégal ko Yeesu. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Mu dikk ba ca soxna sa, jàpp ca loxoom, yékkati ko, tàngooru yaram wa teqalikook soxna sa, mu di leen toppatoo.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Ba ngoon jotee ba jant so, ñu indil Yeesu mboolem ñi wopp ak ñi rab jàpp, <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />dëkk ba bépp daje ca buntu kër ga. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Ci biir loolu ñu bare ñu ame ay jàngoroy jàngoro, mu wéral leen, rab yu bare, mu dàq leen. Waaye gannaaw rab ya xam nañu ko, mayu leen ñu wax.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu wéetoo na ak Yàlla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Ca ëllëg sa, laata bët di set, Yeesu jóg, génn, dem, ba àgg benn béreb bu wéet. Mu di fa ñaan Yàlla. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Ci biir loolu Simoŋ aki àndandoom di ko seet. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Ba ñu ko gisee, ne ko: «Ñépp a ngi lay seet.»<verse eid="MRK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Yeesu ne leen: «Nan dem feneen ci dëkk yi nu wër ngir ma waare foofu itam, ndax looloo ma taxa génn.» <verse eid="MRK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Ci kaw loolu muy wër diiwaanu Galile gépp, di waare ci seeni jàngu, di dàq rab yi.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu faj na ku gaana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Gannaaw loolu genn <char style="w" lemma="gaana:">gaana</char> dikk ba ca moom, di ko ñaan, daldi sukk, ne ko: «Su la soobee, man nga maa setal.» <verse eid="MRK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Yërmande jàpp Yeesu, mu tàllal loxoom, laal ko, ne ko: «Soob na ma, setal.» <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Ca saa sa <char style="w" lemma="ngaana g-:">ngaana</char> ga teqalikook moom, mu set wecc.<verse eid="MRK 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Yeesu nag artu ko bu baax, yiwi ko ca saa sa, ne ko: <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />«Fexeel ba bul wax kenn dara, demal rekk ca <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">sarxalkat</char> ba, ngir mu seet la, te nga génne sa saraxu setlu ni ko yoonu Musaa santaanee<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Sarxalkat yi</char> 14.1-32.</note>, ngir muy firnde ci ñoom.» <verse eid="MRK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Waaye naka la waa ja génn, tàmbalee yéene, siiwal mbir ma, ba tax Yeesu manatula siiwal duggam cib dëkk, xanaa mu féetewoo béreb yu wéet ca fa ko wër. Teewul nit ñiy jóge fu nekk, di ko fekki.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s1">Yeesu faj na ab lafañ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Ba mu amee ay fan Yeesu délsi dëkk ba ñuy wax Kapernawum, nit ñi yég ne ñibbisi na. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Ba mu ko defee ñu bare daje fa, ba xajatuñu ca bunt ba sax. Yeesu nag di leen xamal kàddu gi. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Ci biir loolu ñu dikk, indil ko ab lafañ, ñeenti nit jàppoo ko. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Waaye manuñu koo àggale ca moom ndax mbooloo ma. Ñu yéeg, bënn kaw taax ma, bëtte ko ca wet ga tollook fa Yeesu féete. Ñu yoor nag basaŋ ga lafañ ba tëdd. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Yeesu seetlu seen ngëm, daldi ne lafañ ba: «Doom, jéggalees na la say bàkkaar.»<verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Ay firikati yoonu Musaa nga fa woon toog. Ña ngay wax ca seen xel naan: <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />«Lu kii di wax nii? Yàlla de lay diir mbagg. Ana ku mana jéggaley bàkkaar, ku dul Yàlla doŋŋ?»<verse eid="MRK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Ca saa sa Yeesu yég ci xelam la ñuy nàttable ci seen xel. Mu ne leen: «Li ngeen di nàttable nii ci seen xel, ana lu ko waral? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Ana yii yaar, lu ci gëna yomb: ne lafañ bi “Jéggalees na la say bàkkaar,” am ne ko: “Jógal, jël sa basaŋ te dox”? <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Kon nag dingeen xam ne <char style="w" lemma="Doomu nit k-:">Doomu nit</char> ki am na ci kaw suuf, sañ-sañu jéggale ay bàkkaar.» Mu ne lafañ ba: <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />«Dama ne, jógal, jël sa basaŋ, te ñibbi.» <verse eid="MRK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Mu jóg, jël basaŋ ga ca saa sa, daldi génn fa kanam ñépp, ba ñépp waaru, di sàbbaal Yàlla, naan: «Lu mel nii, masunu koo gis!»<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu woo na Lewi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Yeesu génnati, awe tàkkal dex ga, mbooloo mépp di ñëw ca moom, mu di leen jàngal. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Naka la Yeesuy dem, daldi gis ku ñuy wax Lewi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.14 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Lewi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ak Macë kenn nit ki la.</char></note>, doomu Alfe, mu toog ca juuti ba. Yeesu ne ko: «Kaay, topp ma.» Mu jóg, topp ko.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Yeesoo doon lekk ca kër Lewi, lu bare ci ay <char style="w" lemma="juutikat b-:">juutikat</char> aki bàkkaarkat dikk, ñu bokk di lekk, ñook Yeesu aki taalibeem, ndax ñu baree ko toppoon. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Firikati yoonu Musaa ya bokk ca <char style="w" lemma="Farisen y-:">Farisen</char> ya gis Yeesu bokk lekk ak bàkkaarkat yaak juutikat ya. Ñu ne ay taalibeem: «Juutikat yeek bàkkaarkat yi lay bokkal lekk nag?» <verse eid="MRK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Yeesu nag dégg ca, ne leen: «Du ñi wér ñoo soxla fajkat, ñi wéradi ñoo ko soxla. Du ñi jub laa woosi, bàkkaarkat yi laay woo.»<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Koor am na bésam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Taalibey <char style="w" lemma="Yaxya:">Yaxya</char> ak <char style="w" lemma="Farisen y-:">Farisen</char> yee doon woor. Ay nit dikk, ne Yeesu: «Lu tax taalibey Yaxya ak taalibey Farisen yi di woor, te say taalibe duñu woor?» <verse eid="MRK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Yeesu ne leen: «Ana nu xariti boroom séet mana woore, te boroom séet bi teew ci seen biir? Li feek boroom séet baa ngi ci seen biir duñu mana woor. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Teewul ay jant a ngi ñëw, dees na fi jële boroom séet bi. Bésub keroog nag dinañu woor.<verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />«Kenn du jël sekkit wu yees, di ko daaxe mbubb mu ràpp. Lu ko moy sekkit wi day ñoddi ndimo la ràpp, mbubb ma gëna xar. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Biiñ bu bees it, deesu ko sotti ci mbuusum der yu ràpp. Lu ko moy biiñ bi fàcc mbuus yi, biiñ yàqu, mbuus yi yàqu. Biiñ bu bees daal, mbuus mu bees.»<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bésub Noflaay, Yeesooy boroom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />
    <char style="w" lemma="bésub Noflaay b-:">Bésub Noflaay</char> la Yeesu jaare woon ay tool yu ñor, taalibeem ya ànd ak moom, tàmbalee fàq ay gub ca yoon wa. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" /><char style="w" lemma="Farisen y-:">Farisen</char> ya nag ne Yeesu: «Danu ne, lu waral sa taalibe yi di def lu yoon mayewul ci bésub Noflaay?»<verse eid="MRK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Yeesu ne leen: «Xanaa masu leena jàng la <char style="w" lemma="Daawuda:">Daawuda</char> defoon, ba mu tolloo diggante te xiif, moom ak ña mu àndaloon? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Ba Daawuda duggee ca kër Yàlla ga, jant ya Abyatar dee <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">sarxalkat</char> bu mag ba, <char style="w" lemma="mburum teewal m-:">mburum teewal</char> ma la lekk, te yoon mayewul kenn ku ca lekk, ku dul sarxalkat ba. Sédd na ca sax ña mu àndal.»<verse eid="MRK 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Yeesu dellu ne leen: «Bésub Noflaay, dees koo sàkk ngir nit ki. Waaye nit ki, sàkkeesu ko ngir bésub Noflaay. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Kon <char style="w" lemma="Doomu nit k-:">Doomu nit</char> ki, bésub Noflaay it mooy boroom.»<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yeesu faj na nit ku loxoom làggi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Gannaaw loolu Yeesu duggati ca jàngub Yawut ba. Boroom loxo bu làggee nga fa woon. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Ay <char style="w" lemma="Farisen y-:">Farisen</char> a ngay xool Yeesu, ba xam ndax dina ko faj, te muy <char style="w" lemma="bésub Noflaay b-:">bésub Noflaay</char>, ngir ñu man koo tuumaal. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Yeesu ne boroom loxo bu làggi ba: «Taxawal fii ci digg bi.» <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Yeesu nag ne leen: «Ana lu yoon maye; def lu baax bésub Noflaay am def lu bon? Rawale bakkan am rey?» Ñu ne xerem.<verse eid="MRK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Ci kaw loolu Yeesu dawal bëtu mer, xool leen ñoom ñépp, boole kooku naqar ndax seen xol yu wow. Mu ne waa ja: «Tàllalal loxo bi.» Mu tàllal, loxo ba wér. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Ba loolu amee Farisen ya génn, diisooji ca saa sa ak farandooy Buur Erodd ca mbirum Yeesu, ngir fexe nu ñu ko sànke.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbooloo topp na Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Gannaaw loolu Yeesu aki taalibeem jóge fa, jëm dex ga, mbooloom diiwaanu Galile mu bare topp ko, ak waa diiwaanu Yude itam, <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />ak waa Yerusalem ak Idume<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.8 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Idume </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mooy diiwaanu Edom ci làkku gereg. Ci Yuda la bokkoon, wetu bëj-saalumam.</char></note> ak wàllaa Yurdan ak la wër <char style="w" lemma="Tir:">Tir ak Sidon</char>. Muy mbooloo mu bare mu dégg mboolem la muy def, daldi koy fekki. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Yeesu nag ne ay taalibeem, ñu waajal ko gaal bala ko mbooloo maa tanc. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Ndax booba Yeesu jotoon naa faj ñu bare, ba tax mboolem ña ame ay jàngoro song ko, di ko wuta laal. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" /><char style="w" lemma="rab:">Rab</char> ya itam, saa yu ñu ko gisaa, daldi daanu fa kanamam, tey yuuxu naan: «Yaa di <char style="w" lemma="Doomu Yàlla j-:">Doomu Yàlla</char>.» <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Teewul Yeesu femmu rab ya bu baax, ngir ñu bañ koo siiwal.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu tànn na fukki ndaw ak ñaar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Gannaaw loolu Yeesu yéeg ca tund wa, woo fa ña ko neex, ñooña dikk ba ca moom. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Mu tabb ca fukk ak ñaar, tudde leen ay ndawam, ngir ñuy ànd ak moom, ngir itam, mu di leen yebal, ñu waareji, <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />mu joxaale leen xam-xamu dàq ay rab. <verse eid="MRK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Noonu la tabbe Fukk ak ñaar ñii, di Simoŋ ma muy wax Piyeer, <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />ak Yanqóoba ak Yowaan, doomi Sebede, ña Yeesu di wax Bowanerses, muy firi Doomi dënu, <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />ak Àndre ak Filib ak Bartelemi ak Macë ak Tomaa ak Yanqóoba doomu Alfe, ak Tade ak Simoŋ, Mbokki kuréelu Moom-sa-réew ma, <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />ak Yuda Iskaryo may mujj wor Yeesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gii tooñ la Yàlla dul baale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Yeesu dellooti kër ga, mbooloo ma dajeeti fa, ba moom ak ay taalibeem taluñoo sex dugub sax. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Ay bokkam dégg la xew, daldi dikk, ngir jàppsi ko, naan dafa teqalikoo ak sagoom. <verse eid="MRK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Firikati yoonu Musaa ya jotoona wàccsee Yerusalem it ne: «Kii, Beelsebul a ko jàpp. Buuru rab boobu lay dàqe ay rab.»<verse eid="MRK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Ba mu ko defee Yeesu woo leen, léeb leen ay léeb, ne leen: «Ana nu <char style="w" lemma="Seytaane:">Seytaane</char> mana dàqe Seytaane? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Ag nguur de, su dee xàjjalikoo ci biiram, googa nguur du mana yàgg. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Ag kër it, su dee xàjjalikoo ci biiram, googa kër du mana yàgg. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Seytaane nag, su jógee di xàjjalikoo ci biiram, du mana yàgg, day jeexal rekk.<verse eid="MRK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />«Du kenn moos ku mana dugg kër ponkal, buub alalam! Xanaa mu njëkka yeew ponkal mi, doora mana toj kër ga. <verse eid="MRK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />Maa leen ko wax déy, lu mu mana doon, dees na ko jéggal doom aadama, mu diy bàkkaaram, ak mboolem kàddug saaga Yàlla. <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />Waaye képp ku saaga <char style="w" lemma="Noo gu Sell g-:">Noo gu Sell</char> gi, deesu ko jéggal mukk; day gàddu bàkkaar ba fàww.»<verse eid="MRK 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />La ñu ne <char style="w" lemma="rab:">rab</char> a ko jàpp moo waral mu wax leen loolu.<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Déggal Yàllaa gën bokk ak Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Yaayu Yeesu moo dikkoon, ànd ak ay rakki Yeesu. Ñu taxaw ca biti, yónnee, woo ko. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Booba mbooloo nga toog, wër ko. Ñu ne ko: «Sa yaay ak say rakk kat ñu ngi ci biti, di la seet.» <verse eid="MRK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Yeesu ne leen: «Ana kan mooy sama yaay? Ak ñan ñooy samay rakk?» <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Mu dawal nag bëtam, xool ña ko yéew, daldi ne: «Dama ne, ñii ñooy sama yaay ak samay rakk. <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Ndax kuy jëfe coobarey Yàlla, kooku moo di sama rakk ju góor, di samab jigéen, di sama yaay.»<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Jiwu wuute na aw demin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Yeesu tàmbalee jàngaleeti ca tàkkal dex ga, mbooloo mu bare daje fa moom, ba mu mujj dugg ci gaal, toog ca biir, ca kaw dex ga, mbooloo mépp des ca tàkk ga, feggook ndox ma.<verse eid="MRK 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Noonu Yeesu jàngal leen lu bare ciy léeb. Mu jàngal leen, ne leen: <verse eid="MRK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />«Dégluleen, dama ne, boroom jiwu moo demoon jiwi. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Naka lay saaw, ndeke lenn ca jiwu maa nga tuuru ca kaw yoon wa, picc yi dikk, lekk ko. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Leneen la tuuru fu barey doj, te suuf sa néew. Mu ne coleet ca saa sa, ndax la suuf sa xóotul. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Ba jant bi jógee, mu lakk, daldi wow, ndax ñàkkub reen. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Leneen la tuuru ca xaaxaam ma, xaaxaam ma sëq, tanc ko, ba meññul dara. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />La des ca jiwu ma tuuru ca suuf su baax. Mu sax, màgg, ba meññ; wii fepp meññal fanweer, wee, juróom benn fukk, wale, téeméer.» <verse eid="MRK 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Yeesu nag ne leen: «Ku am nopp yu mu dégge kat, na dégg.»<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Gannaaw loolu Yeesu beru, fukki taalibe yaak ñaar ak ñeneen ñu daje fa moom daldi koy laaj lu léeb yooyuy wund. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Mu ne leen: «Yeen lañu xamal mbóotum nguurug Yàlla, waaye ñi ci biti ñoom, lépp ciy léeb lañu leen koy dëxëñal. <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />Su ko defee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">“Ñuy xoolee xoole te duñu gis,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">di dégloo déglu te duñu dégg,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">ngir bañ ñu dëpp, ñu baal leen<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Esayi</char> 6.9-10.</note>.”»<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Yeesu neeti leen: «Dégguleen woowu léeb? Nu ngeen di dégge léeb yi ci des yépp nag? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Boroom nji mi, kàddu gi lay ji. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Ñi ci kaw yoon wi kàddu giy jiwe, ñooy ñi déglu rekk, <char style="w" lemma="Seytaane:">Seytaane</char> dikk ci saa si, foqati kàddu gi ci ñoom. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Ñee jote jiwu mi fu barey doj ñooy ña déglu kàddu gi rekk, nangoo ko xol bu sedd ci saa si, <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />waaye ab reen la jotula saxle ci ñoom, moo tax duñu ko wéye. Bu coono dikkee mbaa ñu bunduxataal leen ndax kàddu gi, dañuy dellu gannaaw ca saa sa. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Ñeneen ña jote jiwu ma ca xaaxaam ya, ñooy ña déglu kàddu gi, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />te xalaati àddina ak naxey alal ak yeneen xemmemtéef wàllisi, daldi fatt kàddu gi, ba tax meññul. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Ñi jote jiwu mi ci suuf su baax si nag, ñooy ñi déglu kàddu gi, nangu ko, ba meññal; wii fepp, fanweer, wee, juróom benn fukk, wale, téeméer.»<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuy niitu du làqub làmp</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Yeesu neeti leen: «Ndax dees na indib làmp, dëppeg leget? Am dees na indib làmp, yeb ci ron lal? Du dees koy aj ca kaw tegoom? <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Mboolem lu làqu, siiwal lañu ca namm, te mboolem lu umpe, xamle lañu ca namm. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Ku am nopp yu mu dégge daal, na dégg.»<verse eid="MRK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Mu neeti leen: «Teewluleen bu baax li ngeen di dégg. Natt bi ngeen di nattale, moom lees leen di nattale, ba wis leen. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Ku am, dees na ko dolli. Ku amul nag, la mu am as néew sax, dees na ko nangu.»<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jiwu wutul ndimbal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Yeesu teg ca ne: «Nguurug Yàlla dafa mel ni nit ku sànni jiwu fi suuf. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />Buy nelaw ak bu yewwoo, guddi ak bëccëg, jiwu maa ngi sax, di màgg, te xamul nan la koy defe. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Suuf ay meññal boppam gàncax, jiital am ñax, dem ba taxawal aw gub, ba ay pepp mujj fees gub wa. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Pepp ñor, janti ngóob taxaw, mu dawal sàrtam.»<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Doomu fuddën mooy doon fuddën</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Yeesu neeti leen: «Ana lees mana méngaleel nguurug Yàlla sax? Wan léeb lees koy misaale? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Dafa mel ni doomu fuddën. Boo koy ji, moo gëna tuut ci mboolem jiwu. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Waaye boo ko jiwee, mu sax, màgg, ba sut gàncax gépp, daldi sax car yu réy, ba njanaaw yi mana tàgge ci keram.»<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Bare na léeb yu ni mel yu leen Yeesu daan misaale kàddu gi, ca na ñu ko mana xame. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Daawul wax ak ñoom lu moy ci ay léeb. Bu wéetooki taalibeem nag, firil leen lépp.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu dalal na ngelaw la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Bésub keroog ba ngoon jotee Yeesu ne taalibe ya: «Nanu jàll wàllaa dex gi.» <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Ñu daldi bàyyikoo ca mbooloo ma, dem, yóbbaale Yeesu ca gaal ga mu des ba tey, yeneen gaal topp ca moom. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Ba mu ko defee ngelaw la riddeek doole, gannax yay dal ca kaw gaal ga, ba mu bëgga fees. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Teewul Yeesoo nga ca taatu gaal ga, tëdd, gegenu, di nelaw.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 4:38">Taalibe ya yee ko, ne ko: «Kilifa gi, nu ngi sànku, xanaa xalaatoo nu?» <verse eid="MRK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Yeesu yewwu, daldi gëdd ngelaw la, ne dex ga: «Dalal, neel tekk!» Ngelaw la ne tekk, lépp ne sendaw. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Yeesu ne leen: «Lu ngeen di tiit? Dangeena gëmul ba tey?» <verse eid="MRK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Ba loolu amee ñu tiit lool, naan ca seen biir: «Kii nag moo di kan, ba ngelaw leek dex gi sax di ko déggal?»<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yeesu faj na ku rab jàpp</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Gannaaw loolu ñu jàll wàllaa dex ga, ca diiwaanu waa Serasa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.1 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Serasa, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">diiwaan la bu féete dex ga bëj-saalum jàpp penku, ci gox bu ñu dul Yawut dëkke.</char></note>.<verse eid="MRK 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Naka la Yeesu génn gaal ga, jenn waay ju <char style="w" lemma="rab:">rab</char> jàpp bàyyikoo ca sëg ya, dikk dogale ko. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Waa jaa nga dëkkoon ca sëg ya, te ag càllala sax maneesu ko ko woona yeeweeti. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Daan nañu ko farala jéng, yeewe koy càllala, waaye waa ja da daan dagg càllala yi, damm jéng yi, ba kenn amul kàttanu téye ko. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Guddeek bëccëg ma nga woon ca sëg yaak ca tund ya, di yuuxooka for ay xeer, di ko dagge yaramam.<verse eid="MRK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Dafa séen Yeesu fu sore, daldi daw ba agsi, sukk fa kanamam. <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />Mu xaacu ca kaw, ne: «Yaw Yeesu <char style="w" lemma="Doomu Yàlla j-:">Doomu Yàlla</char> Aji Kawe ji, ana lu ma joteek yaw? Dama lay dagaan ngir Yàlla, bu ma mbugal.» <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Booba Yeesoo nga ko naa: «Yaw rab wi, génnal ci waa ji.»<verse eid="MRK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Ci kaw loolu Yeesu ne ko: «Noo tudd?» Mu ne ko: «Gàngoor laa tudd, ndaxte ñu bare lanu.» <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Muy tinu Yeesu lu bare ngir mu bañ leena dàqe ca réew ma.<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Fekk coggalu mbaam-xuux gu mag a nga woon ca tund wa, di for. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Rab ya tinu Yeesu, ne ko: «Yebal nu ci mbaam-xuux yi, ndax nu dugg leen.» <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Mu may ko rab ya, ñu génn, duggi mbaam-xuux ya, coggal ga bartaloondoo, tàbbi ca dex ga, lu wara tollu ci ñaari junniy (2 000) mbaam-xuux daldi lab ca dex ga.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Ba mu ko defee sàmm ya daw, nettaliji ko waa dëkk ba, ak dëkk-dëkkaan ya, nit ña dikk, di seet la xew. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Ñu dikk ba ci Yeesu, daldi gis boroom rab ba, mu solu ba toog, ànd ak sagoom. Nit ña nag tiit. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Ña fekke woon mbir ma daldi leen nettali mbirum boroom rab baak mbaam-xuux ya. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Ci kaw loolu ñuy tinu Yeesu ngir mu génn seen gox ba.<verse eid="MRK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Naka la Yeesu di dugg ca gaal ga, boroom rab ba di tinu Yeesu, ngir ànd ak moom. <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Waaye Yeesu mayu ko ko. Da ne ko: «Ñibbil sa kër ca say bokk, nga àgge leen li la Boroom bi defal lépp ci yërmandeem.» <verse eid="MRK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Waa ja it dem, di tàmbalee siiwtaane ca diiwaan ba ñu dippee Fukki Dëkk, la ko Yeesu defal lépp. Ñépp waaru.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu dekkal na, faj na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Yeesu nag jàllaat dex ga, mbooloo mu bare daje, wër ko fa mu nekk ca tàkkal dex ga. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Ci biir loolu kenn ci njiiti jàngub Yawut ba, ku ñuy wax Yayrus dikk. Naka la gis Yeesu, ne gurub sukk ciy tànkam, <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />di ko tinu lu bare, ne ko: «Sama doom ju jigéen ay bëgga faatu. Ngalla kaay <char style="w" lemma="teg loxo:">teg ko loxo</char>, ngir mu mucc ba dund.» <verse eid="MRK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Yeesu ànd ak moom, dem, mbooloo mu réy topp ca Yeesu, tanc ko.<verse eid="MRK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Sennas ndaw a nga ca woon, fukki at ak ñaar ma ngay xëpp deret. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Fekk na mu sonn coono bu réy bu ko fajkat yu bare teg. Mu sànk ci alalam jépp te jëlewu ci genn tan, xanaa gëna wopp. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Mu déggoon nag turu Yeesu, ba tax mu dikk, dugg ci biir mbooloo mi, doxe ko gannaaw, teg loxoom ca mbubbam. <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />Fekk na mu naan ci xelam: «Su ma fexee ba laal mbubbam rekk, dinaa mucc.» <verse eid="MRK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Ba mu tegee loxoom ca mbubbam Yeesu, ca saa sa la deret ja taxaw, mu yég ci yaramam, ne teqalikoo naak jàngoro ja.<verse eid="MRK 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Yeesu nag yég ca saa sa leer gu bàyyikoo ca moom. Mu walbatiku ca biir mbooloo ma, ne: «Ana ku laal sama mbubb?» <verse eid="MRK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Taalibeem ya ne ko: «Yaa ngi gis mbooloo mi la tanc mépp, nga naa: “Ku ma laal?”» <verse eid="MRK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Teewul Yeesu dawal bëtam fa ko wër, ngir gis ka def loola. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Ndaw saa nga tiit bay lox, ndax xam na xéll la ko dikkal. Mu dikk, ne gurub sukk fa moom, daldi koy wax dëgg gépp. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Yeesu ne ko: «Janq, sa ngëm a la faj. Demal ak jàmm te teqalikook sa jàngoro.»<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Yeesoo ngay wax, noppeegul, aw nit jóge ca kër njiitu jàngu ba, dikk, ne njiit la: «Sa doom faatu na. Jaratul ngay yékkati kilifa gi.» <verse eid="MRK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Yeesu nag tanqamlu wax ja ñu wax. Mu ne njiit la: «Bul tiit, gëmal rekk.» <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Ba Yeesu di dem kër njiit la, mayul kenn mu ànd ak moom ku moy Piyeer ak Yanqóoba ak Yowaan rakku Yanqóoba.<verse eid="MRK 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Ñu agsi kër njiit la, Yeesu yem ca coow la. Ña ngay jooyooka yuuxoo. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Mu duggsi, ne leen: «Lu ngeen di soow aka jooyoo? Xale bi deewul, day nelaw rekk.» <verse eid="MRK 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Waaye ñu di ko ñaawal. Yeesu génne ñépp, daldi woo baayu xale bi ak yaay ji, ak taalibe ya mu àndal, ñu jàll ca biir fa xale ba nekk. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Mu jàpp ca loxol xale ba, ne ko: «Talita kumi,» mu tekki: «Janq, ma ne la, jógal.»<verse eid="MRK 5:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Ca saa sa janq ba jóg, di dox, ndax amoon na fukki at ak ñaar. Ñépp waaru lool. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Ci kaw loolu Yeesu dénku leen bu baax, ne leen bu ko kenn yég, daldi ne ñu may janq bi, mu lekk.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Nasaret gàntal na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Ba loolu amee Yeesu jóge fa, dellu dëkk ba mu yaroo, taalibe ya ànd ak moom.<verse eid="MRK 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />
    <char style="w" lemma="bésub Noflaay b-:">Bésub Noflaay</char> taxaw, mu tàmbalee jàngale ca jàngub Yawut ba, ñu bare dégg ko, yéemu naan: «Ana fu kii jële lii, ak xam-xam bii ñu ko may, lu mu doon, ba yii kéemaan sottee ci moom? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Xanaa kii du minise bi? Du doomu Maryaama ji, magu Yanqóoba ak Yose ak Yudd ak Simoŋ? Xanaa du nook jigéenam ñee fi bokk dëkk?» Ñu daldi gise mbir ma ag yabeel.<verse eid="MRK 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Yeesu nag ne leen: «Ab yonent de, deesu ko xeebe fenn fu moy ci réewu boppam ak ci biiri bokkam ak ci biir waa këram.» <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Foofa Yeesu manu fa woona def genn kéemaan, lu moy jarag yu néew yu mu <char style="w" lemma="teg loxo:">teg loxo</char>, wéral leen. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Yeesu nag yéemu ci seen ngëmadi.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 6:6">Yeesu yeble na</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Ba mu ko defee Yeesu di wër dëkk ya, di jàngale. <verse eid="MRK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Ci biir loolu mu woo Fukk ñaak ñaar, yebal leen ñaar-ñaar, joxaale leen sañ-sañu dàq <char style="w" lemma="rab:">rab</char> yi.<verse eid="MRK 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />Mu jox leen ndigal, ne leen buñu yóbbaale dara ngir fàggu yoon wi, lu moy wenn yet doŋŋ, du mburu, du mbuus, du weccitu xànjar wu ñuy fas ci seen geño. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Mu neeti leen man nañoo sol ay carax waaye buñu yóbbaale ñaari turki. <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Mu ne leen: «Fu ngeen dugge ci kër, dalleen fa, ba kera ngeen dem. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Fépp fu ñu leen dalalul mbaa dégluwuñu leen, bu ngeen fay génne, faxasleen fa pënd bi ci seen tànk, ngir seedeele leen ko seen ngàntal.»<verse eid="MRK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Gannaaw loolu taalibe ya dem, di waare ngir nit ñi tuub. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Ci biir loolu ñu dàq rab yu bare, diw diwu oliw jarag yu bare, ba wéral leen.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yaxya faatu na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Buur <char style="w" lemma="Erodd:">Erodd</char> nag dégg la xew, ndax fekk na Yeesu siiw, ba nit ñi naa: «<char style="w" lemma="Yaxya:">Yaxya</char> ma doon sóobe ci ndox moo dekki noonu, moo waral xam-xam yu kéemaane yi feeñe ci moom.» <verse eid="MRK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Ñenn ña naa: «Kooku <char style="w" lemma="Ilyaas:">Ilyaas</char> la.» Ña ca des naa: «Kooku kay ab yonent la bu bokk ca yonent yu njëkk ya.» <verse eid="MRK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Ba ko Erodd déggee nag da ne: «Yaxya ma ma doglu woon boppam man, Yaxya moomu moo dekki!»<verse eid="MRK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Erodd moom ci boppam moo yónnee woon, jàpp Yaxya, yeew ko, tëj, ndax gannaaw ba Erodd dencee Erojàdd jabaru Filib magam, <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Yaxya moo ko ne: «Yoon mayu la nga denc sa jabaru mag.» <verse eid="MRK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Moo taxoon Erojàdd soxna sa dencal ko mer, ba bëgg koo rey, waaye manu ko woon. <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />Ndaxte Erodd dafa ragaloon Yaxya, te xamoon na ne nit ku jub la te sell, ba tax mu di ko aar. Ku bége woona déglu Yaxya la, doonte la mu ko wax indil na ko njàqare.<verse eid="MRK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Gannaaw gi, bés bu yell ñëw, Erodd doon baaxantal bésu juddoom, daldi cay defal bernde ay jaraafam ak <char style="w" lemma="njiitu gàngoor g-:">njiiti gàngoor</char> yaak kàngami diiwaanu Galile. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Ci biir loolu doomu Erojàdd duggsi, di fecc. Peccum janq ba neex Buur Erodd ak gan ña. Buur ne ko: «Laaj ma loo bëgg, ma jox la ko.» <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Mu giñal ko, ne ko: «Loo ma mana laaj, dinaa la ko jox, ba ci sama genn-wàllu réew mi sax.»<verse eid="MRK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Janq ba nag génn, ne yaayam: «Lu may laaj?» Mu ne ko: «Xanaa boppu Yaxya.» <verse eid="MRK 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Mu daldi gaaw dugg ba ca Buur, wax ko la muy laaj, ne ko: «Damaa bëgg, nga indil ma léegi ci ndab boppu Yaxya.» <verse eid="MRK 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Buur nag daldi am lu ko metti lool, waaye ngiñ la ak gan ña moo tax bëggu koo gàntu. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Buur yebal ab dag, jox ko ndigal ngir mu indil ko boppu Yaxya. Waa ja dem, dog boppu Yaxya ca kaso ba, <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />daldi indi bopp bi ci ndab, jox ko janq ba, janq ba jox ko yaayam. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Ba mu ko defee taalibey Yaxya dégg ko, dikk, yóbbu néew ba, rob ko.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu leel na mbooloo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Ndaw ya nag daje fa Yeesu, nettali ko la ñu def ak la ñu jàngale lépp. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Ci kaw loolu Yeesu ne leen: «Yeen nag dangeen di ñëw, nu daw ba fu wéet, ngeen noppalu fa tuuti.» Booba ñay dem aka dikk dañoo bare, ba taalibe ya talatuñoo lekk sax. <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Ñu jël gaal, daw jëm béreb bu wéet, ngir beruji fa.<verse eid="MRK 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Teewul ñu bare gis leen ñuy dem, daldi xam la ñu nar, dëkkoo dëkk nag nit ña bàbbeekoo ca, tefesu, jiituji leen fa. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Ba Yeesu wàccee ca gaal ga, mbooloo mu réy la gis. Mu ñeewante leen, ndax dañoo mel ni xar yu amul sàmm. Mu daldi leen jàngal lu bare.<verse eid="MRK 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Booba mu ngi bëgga guddi xaat. Taalibe ya dikk, ne ko: «Fii àllub neen la, te mu ngi guddi xaat. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Dangay yiwi mbooloo mi, ñu dugg ci dëkk yu ndaw yii ak dëkk-dëkkaan yi ko wër, ndax ñu jënd lu ñu lekk.» <verse eid="MRK 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Yeesu ne leen: «Yeen joxleen leen lu ñu lekk.» Ñu ne ko: «Xanaa danuy jëndi njëgu ñaari téeméeri poseti xaalis<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.37 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">ñaari téeméeri poseti xaalis, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mu tollook li ab surga daan feyu ci juróom ñetti weer.</char></note> ci mburu, jox leen, ñu lekk?» <verse eid="MRK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Yeesu ne leen: «Ñaata mburu ngeen am? Demleen xool.» Ñu xool, ne ko: «Juróomi mburu la ak ñaari jën.» <verse eid="MRK 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Ba loolu amee Yeesu ne leen ñu toogal ñépp, ñu def ay géew ci ñax mu naat mi. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Ñu toog nag, ñii def géewi téeméer, ñee géewi juróom fukk.<verse eid="MRK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Ba mu ko defee Yeesu jël juróomi mburu ya ak ñaari jën ya, xool kaw asamaan, daldi yékkati kàddug cant, ba noppi dogat mburu ya, jox taalibe ya, ngir ñu taajal ko mbooloo ma. Ñaari jën ya it, mu séddale ko ñépp. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Ñépp lekk ba regg, <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />ba ñu yóbbu fukki pañe ak ñaar yu fees ak desiti mburu yaak jën ya. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Ña lekk ca mburu ya juróomi junniy (5 000) góor lañu.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu dox na ca dex ga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Ci kaw loolu Yeesu duggloo taalibeem ya ca gaal ga, ngir ñu jàllagum, jiituji ca Betsayda ga ca wàlla, ba mu yiwi mbooloo ma. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Mu tàggatook ñoom, daldi yéegi ca tund wa, ngir ñaan. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Ba guddi jotee, gaal gaa nga tollu ca digg dex ga, Yeesu doŋŋ la fekk ca joor ga.<verse eid="MRK 6:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Mu gis nag na taalibe ya sonne ca joow ba ndax booba ngelaw laa leen soflu. Ba suuf di waaja sedd, Yeesu dox ci kaw dex gi, wutsi leen, ba nar leena romb. <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />Ba ñu ko gisee nag muy dox ca kaw dex ga, dañoo foog ne njuuma la, ñu daldi yuuxoo. <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />Ñoom ñépp a jommi ba ñu ko gisee. Mu daldi wax ak ñoom, ne leen: «Dalleen, man mii la, buleen tiit!» <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Mu dugg, fekksi leen ca biir gaal ga, ngelaw la dal. Mbir ma waar leen ba ëlëm leen, <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />ngir fekk na ñu réere mbir kéemaan ga ca mburu ma ndax xol yu fattu.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Ba loolu amee ñu jàll dex ga, daleji diiwaanu Senesaret, taxawal fa gaal ga. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Naka lañu wàcce ca gaal ga, nit ña xàmmee Yeesu. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Ci kaw loolu nit ñay daw ca diiwaan bépp. Ñu tàmbalee jàppoo ña wopp ca seen kawi basaŋ, fépp fu ñu dégg Yeesu, yóbbu leen fa. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Fépp fu mu dugg, muy dëkk bu ndaw, di bu mag, ba ca dëkk-dëkkaan ya, ca pénc mooma lañuy teg jarag ya, tey sarxu Yeesu, mu may leen ñu laal lu mu bon bon cati mbubbam, te képp ku ca laal, mucc nga.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Farisen aada la jiital</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Farisen y-:">Farisen</char> ya ak ñenn ca firikati yoonu Musaa yu jóge Yerusalem ñoo daje woon fa Yeesu. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Ñu gis ñenn cay taalibeem di lekke loxo te raxasuñu ba set ni ko aada bëgge. <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Ndax muy Farisen ya, di Yawut yépp sax, duñu lekk te raxasuñu ba set ndax aaday maam ya ñu baaxoo. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Bu ñu jógee pénc ma it, duñu lekk te tooyluwuñu. Ak yeneen yu bare yu ñu baaxoo yu deme ni tooylu gi war ci jumtukaay yu mel ni ay kaas aki njaq ak ndabi xànjar.<verse eid="MRK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Farisen yaak firikati yoon ya nag laaj ko, ne ko: «Lu tax say taalibe toppuñu aaday maam yi, xanaa ñuy lekke loxo yu setul?» <verse eid="MRK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Yeesu ne leen: «Jinigalkat yi! Naaféq yi ngeen doon! <char style="w" lemma="Esayi:">Esayi</char> yey na, ba mu jottalee kàdduy <char style="w" lemma="waxyu:">waxyu</char> ci seen mbir, noonu ñu ko binde, ne:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">“Askan wii, làmmiñ lañu may wormaale,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">waaye seen xol sore na ma.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Seen njaamu Yàlla neen la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:7">seen njàngale di santaaney niti kese<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.6-7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Esayi</char> 29.13.</note>.”»<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />«Dangeena dëddu santaaney Yàlla, topp aaday nit.» <verse eid="MRK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Mu ne leen: «Yeenaka xam nu ngeen di neenale santaaneb Yàlla, ngir seen aaday bopp mana sax! <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Mu ngi mel ni fi Musaa ne: “Teralal sa ndey ak sa baay,” neeti: “Ku saaga sa ndey mbaa sa baay, dee rekk mooy àtteem<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Mucc ga</char> 20.12; 21.17.</note>.” <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Te yeen ngeen ne: “Ku ne sa ndey mbaa sa baay: Li ma la waroona jàppale, korban (muy firi sarax ngir Yàlla) laa ko def,” <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />may ngeen ko mu baña defalati dara ndeyam mbaa baayam. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Kon seen aaday bopp ji ngeen di donnante, moom ngeen neenale kàddug Yàlla. Ak yeneen yu bare yu ni mel yu ngeen di def.»<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Yeesu wooti mbooloo ma, ne leen: «Dégluleen ma yeen ñépp, te ngeen amug dégg. <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15-16" />Mboolem lu bokkul ci nit ki, du lenn lu ciy dugg ci moom, ba man koo sobeel. Liy génne ci nit ki kay mooy sobeel nit ki.»<verse eid="MRK 7:15-16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Ba ñu duggsee ca biir kër ga, ba sore mbooloo ma, taalibe ya laaj Yeesu, ngir leerlu léeb woowu. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Yeesu ne leen: «Ndeke yeen itam amuleenug dégg? Xamuleen ne mboolem lu bokkul ci nit, du lenn lu ciy dugg ci moom, ba man koo sobeel, <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />ndax du ci xolam lay dugg, waaye ci koll bi lay dugg, balaa jàll, génneji gannaaw kër?» Googu kàddu di firndeel ne ñam yépp a dagan.<verse eid="MRK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Mu neeti leen: «Li génne ci nit, loolu mooy sobeel nit ki. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Ndaxte ci biir nit ki, ci biir xolam la mébét yu bon di jóge, ak séy yi yoon tere, ak càcc, ak bóom, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />ak njaaloo, ak bëgge, ak jëfi coxor, ak njublaŋ, yàqute ak ñeetaane, ak saaga, ak réylu, ak jëf ju xel nanguwul. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Mboolem yu bon yooyii ci biir nit ki lay génne, sobeel ko.»<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu baaxe na jàmbur bu dul yawut</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Yeesu jóge fa, dem ba ca diiwaan ba ñuy wax <char style="w" lemma="Tir:">Tir</char>. Mu dugg fa ci genn kër, te bëggul kenn xam ko, waaye manula fexe ba nit ña umple ko.<verse eid="MRK 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Ndeke as ndaw su <char style="w" lemma="rab:">rab</char> jàpp doomam ju jigéen dégg na fa Yeesu. Mu daldi dikk, ne gurub sukk cay tànkam. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Ndaw sa ab Gereg la woon, cosaanoo Fenisi ga ca Siri.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 7:26">Mu ñaan ko, mu dàqal ko rab wa jàpp doomam. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Yeesu nag ne ko: «Na gone yi njëkka lekk, ba regg; jël ñamu gone yi, sànni ko kuti yi daal jaaduwul.» <verse eid="MRK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Ndaw sa ne ko: «Sang bi, teewul kuti yi, ca suufu ndab la lañuy fore ca ruusiti gone yi.» <verse eid="MRK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Yeesu nag ne ko: «Gannaaw kàddu googu nga wax man ngaa dem, rab wa génn na sa doom.»<verse eid="MRK 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Ndaw sa ñibbi këram, gis doom ja tëdd ca lal ba, fekk rab wa dem na.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu faj na ab tëx-luu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Yeesu jógeeti diiwaanu <char style="w" lemma="Tir:">Tir</char>, jaare dëkk ba ñuy wax Sidon, jaare diiwaan ba ñuy wax Fukki Dëkk yi, dem ba ca dexu Galile.<verse eid="MRK 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Ñu indil fa Yeesu ku tëx, te wax jafe ko. Ñu ñaan Yeesu, ne ko mu <char style="w" lemma="teg loxo:">teg ko loxoom</char>. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Yeesu génne waa ja mbooloo ma, ñaarook moom, daldi def ay baaraamam ci noppi waa ja, ba noppi tifli, laalale loram làmmiñu waa ja. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Ci kaw loolu mu xool kaw asamaan, daldi binni, ne ko: «Efata», muy firi «Tijjikul.» <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Ca saa sa ay noppam tijjiku, làmmiñ wa yiwiku, muy wax wax ju leer.<verse eid="MRK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Ba mu ko defee Yeesu dénku leen, ne leen buñu ko wax kenn, waaye lu mu leen gëna dénku, ñu gën koo siiwal. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Dañoo waaru ba fa waaru yem, naan: «Kii lépp lu mu def, jëf ju matale la, ba tëx yi sax, mu déggloo leen, luu yi, mu waxloo leen!»<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s1">Yeesu leelati na mbooloo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Ca fan yooya mbooloo mu réy a dajewaatoon te amuñu lu ñu lekk. Yeesu woo taalibe ya, ne leen: <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />«Damaa yërëm mbooloo mi, ndax ñetti fan a ngii yu ñu nekk ak man, te amuñu lu ñu lekk. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Su ma leen yiwee, ñu ñibbaale xiif, dinañu tële ci yoon wi, ndax am na ci ñu jóge fu sore.» <verse eid="MRK 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Taalibeem ya ne ko: «Waaye fu nit di jële mburu mu suur ñii ci àll bu wéet bii?» <verse eid="MRK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Yeesu ne leen: «Ñaata mburu ngeen am?» Ñu ne ko: «Juróom ñaar.»<verse eid="MRK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Ba mu ko defee Yeesu sant mbooloo ma ñu toog ci suuf. Mu jël juróom ñaari mburu ya, daldi yékkati kàddug cant, dagg ko, jox taalibe ya, ngir ñu taajal ko mbooloo ma. Ñu taajal leen ko. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Dese woon nañu fa it tuuti jën yu ndaw. Yeesu jël ko, daldi ñaan mu barkeel. Mu sant nag taalibe ya ñu séddale loola itam. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Ñu daldi lekk ba regg, ba yóbbu desit wa, yebe ci juróom ñaari dàmba, <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />te lu tollook ñeenti junniy (4 000) góor a nga fa woon. Yeesu nag yiwi leen, <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />daldi dugg ak taalibe ya ca gaal ga, ñu jàll ba diiwaanu Dalmanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Diiŋatkat sàkku na firnde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Farisen y-:">Farisen</char> yaa dikkoon, di weranteek Yeesu. Ñu di ko fiir, ba tax ñuy sàkku ci moom firnde ju bawoo asamaan. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Yeesu nag binni binni gu réy, daldi ne: «Ana lu waral maasug tey jii di wut firnde? Maa leen ko wax déy, du jenn firnde jees di jox maasug tey jii.» <verse eid="MRK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Ci kaw loolu Yeesu bàyyikoo ca ñoom, duggaat, jëm wàllaa dex.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Farisen jikkoy lawiir la yor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Fekk na taalibe ya fàttee yóbbaale mburu, te amuñu woon lu dul menn mburu ca gaal ga. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Yeesu nag jox leen ndigal lii, ne leen: «Wattuleen! Bàyyileen xel lawiiru <char style="w" lemma="Farisen y-:">Farisen</char> ñi, ak lawiiru Buur <char style="w" lemma="Erodd:">Erodd</char>.»<verse eid="MRK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Taalibe ya nag di werante ci seen biir, naan: «Nun de amunu fi mburu.» <verse eid="MRK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Yeesu xam la ñuy wax, ne leen: «Lu ngeen di werante, naan amuleen fi mburu? Kon xanaa daal xamaguleen ba tey, te ràññeewuleen? Am seenum xel a dërkiis? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Dangeena ami gët, te dungeen gis? Am dangeena ami nopp te dungeen dégg, dungeen fàttaliku? <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />Ba ma daggalee juróomi junniy (5 000) nit ña juróomi mburu ya, ba ngeen for desit ya, ñaata pañey dogi mburu la fees?» Ñu ne ko: «Fukk ak ñaar.» <verse eid="MRK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />Mu neeti leen: «Juróom ñaari mburu ya ca ñeenti junniy (4 000) nit ña nag, ba ngeen foree desit ya, ñaata dàmbay dogi mburu la fees?» Ñu ne ko: «Juróom ñaar.»<verse eid="MRK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Yeesu nag ne leen: «Te xamaguleen ba tey?»<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu wéral na silmaxa ca Betsayda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Gannaaw loolu Yeesu aki taalibeem agsi dëkk ba ñuy wax Betsayda. Ñu indil fa Yeesu ku gumba, di ko ñaan, mu <char style="w" lemma="teg loxo:">teg ko loxo</char>. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Yeesu jàpp loxob silmaxa ba, yóbbu ko, ba génn dëkk ba. Mu tifli ci bët yi, teg ko loxo, ne ko: «Ndax yaa ngi gis dara?» <verse eid="MRK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Waa ji xippi, ne ko: «Gis naa ay nit ñu mel ni ay garab, waaye ñu ngi dox.» <verse eid="MRK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Yeesu dellu tegaat ay loxoom ci bët yi, silmaxa bi ne xiféet, daldi wér, di ràññee lépp bu baax. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Ci kaw loolu Yeesu sant ko mu ñibbi, ne ko: «Bul dellu ci biir dëkk bi.»<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Piyeer ràññee na Almasi bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Ba loolu amee Yeesu ànd aki taalibeem, ñu jëm ca dëkk-dëkkaan, ya ca wetu Sesare gu Filib. Mu laaj taalibe ya ca yoon wa, ne leen: «Ana ku nit ñi wax ne moom laa?» <verse eid="MRK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Ñu ne ko: «Ñii nee ñu yaa di <char style="w" lemma="Yaxya:">Yaxya</char>, ñee ne yaa di <char style="w" lemma="Ilyaas:">Ilyaas</char>, ñale ne kenn ci yonent yi nga.»<verse eid="MRK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Yeesu it ne leen: «Yeen nag, ngeen ne maay kan?» Piyeer ne ko: «Yaa di <char style="w" lemma="Almasi b-:">Almasi</char> bi.» <verse eid="MRK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Ci kaw loolu Yeesu femmu leen ngir ñu baña wax kenn dara ci mbiram.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu xamle na deewam ak ndekkiteem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Yeesu nag tàmbali leena jàngal, ne leen fàww <char style="w" lemma="Doomu nit k-:">Doomu nit</char> ki sonn lu bare, ba dajeek mbañeelu magi askan wi ak <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">sarxalkat</char> yu mag yi, ak firikati yoonu Musaa yi, te dees na ko rey, ba mu am ñetti fan, mu dekki. <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Mu daldi leen xamal mbir mi, ba mu leer nàññ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:32">Piyeer nag ñaarook moom, tàmbali koo femmu. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Teewul Yeesu geestu, gis yeneen taalibe yi, daldi gëdd Piyeer, ne ko: «<char style="w" lemma="Seytaane:">Seytaane</char>, xiddi ma te dellu gannaaw, yaw xalaatoo yëfi Yàlla, waaye yëfi nit ngay xalaat.»<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Ba loolu amee Yeesu woo mbooloo maak taalibe ya, ne leen: «Ku ma bëgga topp, fàtteel sa bopp te gàddu sa bant bi ñu lay daaj, door maa topp. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Ndaxte képp ku bëgga rawale sa bakkan, dinga ko ñàkk, te ku ñàkk sa bakkan ndax man ak xibaaru jàmm bi, dinga ko jotaat. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Ana luy njariñal nit ku jagoo àddina sépp, te ñàkk bakkanam? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Ana lu nit wara mana weccee bakkanam? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Képp ku kersawoo sama jëmm, kersawoo topp samay wax, ci biir niti jamono jii, di jamonoy bokkaaleek bàkkaar, bés bu Doomu nit ki dikkee ci biir darajay Baayam, ànd ak malaaka yu sell yi, su keroogee moom it dina la kersawoo.»<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Mu neeti leen: «Maa leen ko wax, déy, ñenn a ngi taxaw fii, duñu dee te gisuñu nguurug Yàlla dikk ak doole.»<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Darajay Yeesu feeñ na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Ba ñu ca tegee juróom benni fan, Yeesu ànd na ak Piyeer ak Yanqóoba ak Yowaan, yóbbu leen kaw tund wu kawe, ngir wéetook ñoomu neen. Mu soppiku fa seen kanam: <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />ay yéreem ne ràññ, weex tàll weexaay bu raw lu fóotkatub àddina mana fóot. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Ci kaw loolu Yonent Yàlla <char style="w" lemma="Ilyaas:">Ilyaas</char> feeñu leen, mook Yonent Yàlla Musaa, ñuy waxtaan ak Yeesu.<verse eid="MRK 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Piyeer daldi ne Yeesu: «Kilifa gi, su nu toogoon fii de, mu baax ci nun. Nan yékkati ñetti mbaar, benn yaw, benn Musaa, benn Ilyaas.» <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Booba Piyeer xamul sax lu muy wax, ndax tiitaange ju leen jàpp. <verse eid="MRK 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Ci kaw loolu aw niir dikk, yiir leen, baat jibe ca niir wa, ne: «Kii mooy sama Doom, sama soppe, dégluleen ko.» <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Taalibe yi jekki xool wet gu nekk, waaye gisatuñu kenn ku dul mennum Yeesu doŋŋ, mook ñoom.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Naka lañuy wàcce ca tund wa Yeesu sant leen, ne leen ñu baña nettali kenn la ñu gis, ba kera <char style="w" lemma="Doomu nit k-:">Doomu nit</char> ki dekki. <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Ñu jàpp wax jooju nag ci seen biir tey sottante xel, ngir xam lu «dee-dekki» di tekki.<verse eid="MRK 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Ci kaw loolu taalibe ya laaj ko, ne ko: «Lu tax firikati yoonu Musaa yi ne fàww Ilyaas njëkka ñëw?» <verse eid="MRK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Yeesu ne leen: «Waaw, Ilyaas kay mooy njëkka ñëw, ba jubbanti lépp. Waaye lu tax ñu bind ci Doomu nit ki, ne fàww mu sonn coono bu bare, te dees na ko xeeb? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Waaye maa leen wax ne Ilyaas ñëw na, lu leen neex lañu def ak moom, te noonu lañu ko binde woon ci moom.»<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu dàq na rab wa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Ba ñu waññikoo ba jub yeneen taalibe ya, dañoo gis mbooloo mu bare yéew leen, ay firikati yoon di weranteek ñoom. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Mbooloo ma mépp daldi gis Yeesu, teewaayam bett leen. Ñu dawsi, nuyu ko.<verse eid="MRK 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Ba loolu amee Yeesu laajte, ne: «Ana lu ngeen di weranteek ñii?» <verse eid="MRK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Kenn ca mbooloo ma ne ko: «Kilifa gi, sama doom ju góor laa la indil. Aw rab wuy luuloo ko jàpp. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Saa su ko dikkalee, da koy daaneel ci suuf, gémmiñ gi di fuur, muy yéyu, ne jàdd. Say taalibe laa ñaan ñu dàq rab wi, waaye manuñu ko.» <verse eid="MRK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Yeesu ne leen: «Céy niti tey, yeena gëmadi! Maak yeen ba kañ? Dama leen di muñal ba kañ? Indilleen ma xale bi.» <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Ñu indil ko ko. Rab wa gis Yeesu rekk daldi sayloo xale ba, mu daanu fa suuf, di xalangu, gémmiñ gay fuur. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Yeesu ne baay ba: «Lii kañ la ko dal?» Mu ne ko: «Ba muy gone ba tey. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Bare na lu mu koy xabtal ci sawara mbaa cim ndox, ngir sànk ko. Waaye soo ci manee lenn, yërëm nu, xettalee nu ko.» <verse eid="MRK 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Yeesu ne ko: «Nga ne: “Soo manee”? Ku ànd ak gëm kay, dara tëwu la.»<verse eid="MRK 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Baayu xale bi daldi àddu ca kaw, ne: «Kon gëm naa, ngalla wallu maak sama ngëmadi.»<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Ci biir loolu Yeesu gis mbooloo mu dawandoo di dikk, mu daldi gëdd <char style="w" lemma="rab:">rab</char> wa, ne ko: «Yaw rab wiy luulooka tëxloo, maa la ne génnal ci kii te bul duggati ci moom.» <verse eid="MRK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Ba mu ko defee rab wa yuuxu, daldi sayloo xale ba bu metti, doora génn. Xale bi ne nemm, ni ku dee, ba ñu bare ne dee na. <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Teewul Yeesu jàpp ca loxo ba, yékkati ko, mu taxaw.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Ba Yeesu duggee ca kër ga, taalibe ya laaj ko ci sutura, ne ko: «Lu tax manunu woona dàqal sunu bopp, rab wi?» <verse eid="MRK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Yeesu ne leen: «Xeetu rab wii, maneesu koo dàqe lenn lu moy ñaan.»<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu xamlewaat na deewam ak ndekkiteem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Foofa lañu bàyyikoo, jaare diiwaanu Galile, waaye Yeesu bëggul kenn yég ko. <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />Ndaxte booba ma ngay jàngal taalibe ya, naan leen: «<char style="w" lemma="Doomu nit k-:">Doomu nit</char> ki lees di wor, ngir teg ko ci loxoy nit, ñu rey ko, te gannaaw bu ñu ko reyee dina dekki ci ñetti fan.» <verse eid="MRK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Taalibe ya nag xamuñu woon lu kàddu googuy tekki, waaye ñemewuñu ko koo laaj.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kan moo gëna màgg?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Ba ñu àggee dëkk ba ñuy wax Kapernawum, ba dugg ca kër ga, Yeesu laaj leen, ne leen: «Lu ngeen doon waxtaane ci yoon wi?» <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Ñu ne cell, ndax la ñu doon werante ca yoon wa moo di kan moo gëna kawe ci ñoom.<verse eid="MRK 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Ba mu ko defee Yeesu toog, woo fukki taalibe yaak ñaar, ne leen: «Ku bëgga jiitu, na mujj ñépp te di surgab ñépp.» <verse eid="MRK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Yeesu daldi indi ab xale, taxawal ko ci seen biir. Ci kaw loolu mu fab xale bi, ne leen: <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />«Képp ku dalal xale bu mel nii ndax man, man mii nga dalal, te képp ku ma dalal, du man nga dalal, waaye ki ma yebal nga dalal.»<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ku sotul nit, yaa far ak moom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Yowaan ne ko: «Kilifa gi, danoo gis kuy dàq ay rab ci sa tur, nu aaye ko, ndax bokkul ci nun.» <verse eid="MRK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Yeesu nag ne ko: «Buleen ko aaye, ndaxte kenn manula def kéemaan ci sama tur, daldi ci teg wax ju bon ci man. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Képp ku nu sotul, nun la faral. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Maa leen ko wax, déy, képp ku leen may ab kaasu ndox, ngir li ngeen di niti <char style="w" lemma="Almasi b-:">Almasi</char> bi, doo ñàkk sag pey mukk.<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bàkkaarloo nit aay na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />«Waaye kenn sax ci xale yii ma gëm, képp ku ko bàkkaarloo, li gën ci moom, mooy ñu takk ci baatam doju wolukaay wu réy wu mbaam di wëndeel, daldi koy sànni biir géej. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43-44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43-44" />Su la sab loxo bàkkaarloo, dog ko. Tàbbiwaale ab kuuñ ca dund gu wóor ga moo gën ci yaw, nga tàbbiwaale sa ñaari loxo biir jànnama, sawara sa dul fey. <verse eid="MRK 9:43-44" /><verse number="45-46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45-46" />Su la sab tànk bàkkaarloo, dog ko. Tàbbiwaale bennub tànk ca dund gu wóor ga moo gën ci yaw, ñu boole laak sa ñaari tànk, sànni la biir jànnama. <verse eid="MRK 9:45-46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Su la sa bët bàkkaarloo, luqil. Tàbbiwaale patt ci nguurug Yàlla, moo gën ci yaw ñu boole laak sa ñaari bët, sànni biir sawara,<verse eid="MRK 9:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />“foofa sax ya dul deewe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 9:48">sawara sa du fa feye<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.48 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Esayi</char> 66.24.</note>.”<verse eid="MRK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />Ñépp nag sawara lañu leen di setale ni xorom di setale<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.49 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">sawara siy setal </char><char style="ft" closed="false">man naa nekk mitit yeek coono yi aji gëm ji wara jànkoonteel ci àddina. Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">1.Piyeer</char> 1.7; 4.12-13.</note>. <verse eid="MRK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />Xorom lu baax la, waaye bu raxee ba sàlli, nees koy delloo cafkaam? Nangeen jikkowoo xorom su raxul, daldi jàmmoo.»<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Pase warul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Yeesu jóge foofa, dem réewum Yude ak ca wàllaa dexu Yurdan. Mbooloo yu bare fekkseeti ko, mu di leen jàngalati, na mu ko baaxoo woon.<verse eid="MRK 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Ci kaw loolu ay <char style="w" lemma="Farisen y-:">Farisen</char> dikk, di ko fiir, laaj ko, ne ko: «Ndax yoon maye na nit fase jabaram?» <verse eid="MRK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Yeesu ne leen: «Lu leen Musaa sant?» <verse eid="MRK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Ñu ne ko: «Musaa maye na kayitu pase gu nit kiy bind, ngir fase jabaram.» <verse eid="MRK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Yeesu nag ne leen: «Seen dëgër xol a tax Musaa bindal leen loolu ndigal. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Waaye ca njàlbéen ga Yàlla sàkke àddina, ca la leen sàkk ñuy ku góor ak ku jigéen. <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />Looloo tax góor di teqalikook ndeyam ak baayam, taqoo ak jabaram, <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />ba ñoom ñaar di wenn suux doŋŋ. Moo tax dootuñu ñaar, waaye wenn suux doŋŋ lañu. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Lu Yàlla takk nag, bu ko nit tas.»<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Ba ñu delloo ca kër ga taalibe ya laaj ko ca mooma mbir. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Yeesu ne leen: «Ku fase sa jabar, takk keneen, njaaloo nga, ndax sa jabar ja nga fase, <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />te ki tas ak jëkkëram, su séyaatee ak keneen, njaaloo na.»<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Xale am na cér</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Ay xale lañu indiloon Yeesu ngir mu <char style="w" lemma="teg loxo:">teg leen ay loxoom</char>. Teewul taalibe ya jànni leen. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Yeesu gis ko, daldi mer, ne leen: «Bàyyileen xale yi, ñu ñëw fi man! Buleen leen aaye, ndax ñu mel ni ñoom ñoo yelloo nguurug Yàlla. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Maa leen ko wax déy, képp ku baña nangul nguurug Yàlla ni ab xale, doo ca tàbbi mukk.» <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Yeesu nag fab leen, teg leen ay loxoom, barkeel leen.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Texe jafe na boroom alal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Yeesoo doon dox ciw yoon, jenn waay dawsi ba ca moom, daldi sukk ca kanamam, ne ko: «Kilifa gu baax bi, ana lu may def, ngir texe ba fàww?» <verse eid="MRK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Yeesu ne ko: «Lu tax nga naa ma ku baax ki? Kenn baaxul ku moy Yàlla doŋŋ. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Xam nga ndigal yi: “Bul bóom, bul njaaloo, bul sàcc, bul seede lu dul dëgg, bul xañ nit àqam, teralal sa ndey ak sa baay<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Mucc ga</char> 20.12-16.</note>.”» <verse eid="MRK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Waa ja ne ko: «Kilifa gi, loolu lépp ba may ndaw laa ko dale sàmm ba tey.»<verse eid="MRK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Yeesu nag xool ko bëti cofeel, daldi ne ko: «Lenn rekk moo la dese. Demal te lépp loo am, nga jaay ko, jox ko néew-doole yi. Su ko defee nga woomle fa asamaan. Boo noppee, ñëwal topp ci man.» <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Waa ja am mbetteel ca kàddu ga, daldi fay jóge aku tiis ndax ku bare alal la woon.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Ba loolu amee Yeesu dawal bëtam fa ko wër, daldi ne taalibe ya: «Boroom alal tàbbi ci nguurug Yàlla, ndaw lu jafe!» <verse eid="MRK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Wax jooju nag jaaxal taalibe ya. Yeesu neeti leen: «Gone yi, tàbbi ci nguurug Yàlla, ndaw lu jafe! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Boroom alal tàbbi ci nguurug Yàlla, giléem jaare bën-bënu puso moo ko gëna yomb.» <verse eid="MRK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Wax jooju gënatee yéem taalibe ya, ñu naan ca seen biir: «Ku mana mucc nag?» <verse eid="MRK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Yeesu ne leen jàkk, daldi ne: «Nit la të, waaye tëwul Yàlla. Yàlla man na lépp.»<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Piyeer daldi ne ko: «Waaw, nun de lépp lanu dëddu, topp la!» <verse eid="MRK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Yeesu ne ko: «Maa leen ko wax déy, amul kenn kuy dëddu kër, mbaa doomi ndey yu góor mbaa yu jigéen, mbaa ndey mbaa baay, mbaa doom, mbaa suuf, ngir maak xibaaru jàmm bi, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />te jotuloo ci jamonoy tey jii téeméeri yoon, la nga amoon ciy kër, ak doomi ndey yu góor ak yu jigéen, ak ndey ak doom ak suuf, ba jotaale coonoy bunduxataal, ak texe ba fàww gooy jot ëllëg. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Waaye ñu baree ngi jiitu tey, ñooy mujji, te ñu baree ngi mujje tey, ñooy jiituji.»<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu yégleeti na deewam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Ñu ànd ca yoon wa, jëm Yerusalem, Yeesu jiitu leen, taalibe ya waaru, ña ca topp tiit. Yeesu nag wéetook Fukk ñaak ñaar, di leen xamal mbir ya ko nara dikkal. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />Mu ne leen: «Noo ngii jëm Yerusalem, te dees na wor <char style="w" lemma="Doomu nit k-:">Doomu nit</char> ki, jébbal ko <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">sarxalkat</char> yu mag yaak firikati yoonu Musaa ya, ñu teg ko àtteb dee, jébbal ko jàmbur ñi dul Yawut. <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />Ñu ñaawal ko, tifli ko, caw ko, ba noppi rey ko, ñetti fan tege ca, mu dekki.»<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Njiit, surga la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Ci kaw loolu Yanqóoba ak Yowaan, doomi Sebede dikk fa Yeesu. Ñu ne ko: «Kilifa gi, danoo bëggoon nga defal nu li nu lay ñaan.» <verse eid="MRK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Yeesu ne leen: «Lu ngeen bëgg, ma defal leen ko?» <verse eid="MRK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Ñu ne ko: «May nu nu toog, kii féete la ndijoor, kii féete la càmmoñ, keroog ca sa jataayu daraja ba.» <verse eid="MRK 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Yeesu ne leen: «Xamuleen li ngeen di ñaan. Mbaa kaasub naqar bi may naani, man ngeen koo naan? Am sóobu gu metti gi ma sóobu, man ngeen koo sóobu?» <verse eid="MRK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Ñu ne ko: «Man nanu ko.» Yeesu ne leen: «Kaasub naqar bi may naani de, dingeen ko naan, sóobu gu metti gi ma sóobu it, dingeen ko sóobu, <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />tooge sama ndijoor mbaa sama càmmoñ nag, du maa koy maye, waaye ña ñu ko waajalal lay seen cér.»<verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Ba fukki taalibe ya ca des déggee mbir ma, seen xol tàmbali tàng ca Yanqóoba ak Yowaan. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Yeesu daldi leen woo, ne leen: «Xam ngeen ne ñi xeeti àddina yi def seeni njiit, dañu leen di def jaam, seeni kàngam di leen néewal doole. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Yeen nag, bumu deme noonu ci seen biir. Ku bëgga doon ku màgg ci yeen, na nekk seen surga, <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />te ku bëgga nekk seen njiit, na doon jaamub ñépp. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Ndax <char style="w" lemma="Doomu nit k-:">Doomu nit</char> ki itam ñëwul ngir ñu di ko surgawu, xanaa ngir di nekk surga, ba far maye bakkanam, def ko <char style="w" lemma="jot:">njotug</char> ñu bare.»<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu faj na Bartime silmaxa ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Yeesu ak taalibeem ya nag agsi dëkk ba ñuy wax Yeriko. Naka lañuy génne Yeriko, mbooloo mu takku topp leen. Ci biir loolu ab silmaxa bu ñuy wax Bartime, tur wa di tekki doomu Time, ma nga tooge ca peggu yoon wa, di yalwaan. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Mu dégg ne Yeesum Nasaret mooy jubsi, ba tax muy xaacu, naan: «Yeesu Sëtub <char style="w" lemma="Daawuda:">Daawuda</char>, yërëm ma!» <verse eid="MRK 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Ba loolu amee ñu bare femmu ko, ngir mu noppi. Teewul mu gëna xaacooti, ne: «Sëtub Daawuda, yërëm ma!»<verse eid="MRK 10:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Yeesu daldi taxaw, ne: «Wooleen ko!» Ñu woo silmaxa ba, ne ko: «Dallul te jóg, mu ngi lay woo.» <verse eid="MRK 10:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Mu sànni malaanam, ne layy, dikk ba ca Yeesu. <verse eid="MRK 10:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Yeesu ne ko: «Ana loo bëgg, ma defal la ko?» Silmaxa ba ne ko: «Xanaa ma dellu di gis, sama kilifa.» <verse eid="MRK 10:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Yeesu ne ko: «Demal. Sa ngëm musal na la.» Ca saa sa muy gis, daldi topp Yeesu ca yoon wa.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Yeesu dugg na Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Gannaaw loolu Yeesu ak taalibe ya dikk ba jub Yerusalem, ba agsi dëkk ya ñuy wax Betfase ak Betani ca wetu <char style="w" lemma="tundu Oliw y-:">tundu Oliw</char> ya. Yeesu yebal ñaar ca taalibe ya, <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />ne leen: «Demleen ci dëkk bi ci seen kanam. Bu ngeen agsee rekk, dingeen fa gis cumbur bu yeewe, bu kenn masula war. Yiwileen ko, indi. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Bu ñu leen nee: “Lu ngeen di def nii?”, ngeen ne: “Boroom bee ko soxla, dina ko delloosi léegi.”»<verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Taalibe ya dem, daldi gis ab cumbur ci mbedd mi, mu yeewe ci buntu kër. Ñu yiwi ko. <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />Ñenn ca ña fa taxaw ne leen: «Lu ngeen di def nii, bay yiwi cumbur bi?» <verse eid="MRK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Ñu tontu leen la leen Yeesu waxoon, nit ña bàyyi leen.<verse eid="MRK 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Ñu indil Yeesu cumbur ba, daldi teg seeni yére ca kawam, Yeesu war<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.7 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">cumbur: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ci jamonoy jàmm, jamono yu xeex amul woon, buur yi daan nañu war mbaam, te doonul lu ñu leen di tuutal.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Ñu bare nag lal seeni yére ca yoon wa, ñenn ña lal ay cari garab yu sëq yu ñu dagge ca tool ya. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Ci kaw loolu ña jiitu ak ña topp ca Yeesu xaacoondoo, naan:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">«<char style="w" lemma="Osaana:">Osaana</char>!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">Na barke wàcc ci ki dikk ci turu Boroom bi!<verse eid="MRK 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Na barke wàcc ci nguur giy ñëw, sunu nguurug maam <char style="w" lemma="Daawuda:">Daawuda</char>!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:10">Osaana, na cant jibe béreb ya gëna kawe!»<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Yeesu nag agsi Yerusalem, dugg ca kër Yàlla ga. Ba mu xoolee lépp ca biir, ba noppi, yemook mu guddi, mu ànd ak fukki taalibe yaak ñaar, jubal dëkk ba ñuy wax Betani.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu dàq na jaaykat ya ca kër Yàlla ga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Ba bët setee ñu génne Betani. Ci biir loolu Yeesu xiif. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Mu séen fu sore garabu figg gu sëq. Mu jàdd, di seeti, ndax dina ca fekk dara. Mu dem ba ca figg ga, gisul lu dul ay xob, ndax booba figg amagul. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Ci kaw loolu mu ne figg ga: «Yàlla bu kenn lekkati sab doom!» Taalibe ya di ca dégg.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Ñu délsi Yerusalem, Yeesu dugg ca kër Yàlla ga, daldi dàq ñay jaay aka jënd ca kër Yàlla ga. Mu dëpp taabali weccikati xaalis ya, ak tooguy jaaykati pitax ya, <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />ba noppi bàyyiwul kenn, mu dugal lenn ca kër Yàlla ga. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Mu di leen jàngal nag, wax leen, ne leen: «Xanaa bindeesul ne:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:17">“Sama kër gi, kërug ñaan lees ko tudde,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:17">ñeel xeetoo xeet<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Esayi</char> 56.7.</note>.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MRK 11:17">Waaye yeen, moom ngeen def rawtub sàcc.»<verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />
    <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">Sarxalkat</char> yu mag yaak firikati yoonu Musaa ya dégg loolu, ragal ko, di ko fexee rey, ndax mbooloo mépp a yéemu woon ca njàngaleem.<verse eid="MRK 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Timis jot, Yeesu ànd ak taalibe ya, génn dëkk ba.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Ba ñuy dem ca suba teel lañu gis garabu figg ga wow koŋŋ, ba ca reen ya. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Piyeer nag fàttaliku, ne Yeesu: «Kilifa gi, xoolal, figg ga nga rëbboon wow na koŋŋ!»<verse eid="MRK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Yeesu ne leen: «Gëmleen Yàlla. <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Maa leen ko wax déy, képp ku ne tund wale: “Jógal, tàbbiji géej,” te bañ cee boole xel ñaar, xanaa gëm ne li nga wax dina am, noonu lees la koy nangule. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Moo tax ma di leen wax lii: Lépp lu ngeen di sàkku cig ñaan, gëmleen ne jot ngeen ko ba noppi, dingeen ko am. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25-26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25-26" />Bu ngeen taxawee di ñaan it, te fekk ngeen jàppal kenn dara, baalleen ko, ngir seen Baay ba fa asamaan baal leen seeni tooñ, yeen itam.»<verse eid="MRK 11:25-26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu mooy boroom sañ-sañ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Ñu dellooti Yerusalem. Ci kaw loolu Yeesu dugg kër Yàlla ga, di doxantu ca biir ëtt ba. <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">Sarxalkat</char> yu mag yaak firikati yoonu Musaa yaak magi askan wa dikk ba ca moom, <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />ne ko: «Lii ngay def, ci ban sañ-sañ nga koy defe? Ak ku la jox sañ-sañu def ko?»<verse eid="MRK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Yeesu ne leen: «Ma laaj leen man itam lenn; tontuleen ma ci, ma wax leen ci ban sañ-sañ laay defe lii. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Sóobeb <char style="w" lemma="Yaxya:">Yaxya</char> ci ndox, ndax asamaan la ndigal la bawoo, am ci nit ñi la bawoo? Tontuleen ma ci loolu.»<verse eid="MRK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Ñu diisoo, daldi ne: «Su nu nee: “Asamaan la ndigal la bawoo,” da naan: “Lu tax kon gëmuleen Yaxya?” <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Ndax danuy wax ne ci nit ñi la bawoo?» Booba mbooloo ma lañu ragal, ndax ñépp a jàppoon ne Yaxya ab yonent dëgg la woon. <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Ñu daldi ne Yeesu: «Loolu xamunu ko.» Yeesu ne leen: «Kon man itam duma leen wax ci ban sañ-sañ laay defe lii.»<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Léebu beykat ya tiiñal na njiit ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Yeesu nag teg ca di wax ak ñoom ci ay léeb. Mu ne leen: «Ab tóokëru reseñ la nit jëmbatoon. Mu ñag tóokër bi, gas ca paxum nalukaayu reseñ, tabax ca taaxum wattukaay, ba noppi batale tóokër ba ay beykat, daldi tukki.<verse eid="MRK 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />«Ba wittum reseñ jotee, mu yebal ab surga ca beykat ya, ñu jëlsi wàllam ca meññeef ma. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Beykat ya jàpp ko, dóor ko, dàq ko, mu dellu loxoy neen. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Boroom tóokër ba yebalaat beneen surga, ñu xaañ ko, toroxal ko. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Mu yebalati beneen surga, ñu rey ko. Mu dellu yebal ñu bare, ñii ñu dóor leen, ñii ñu rey.<verse eid="MRK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />«Boroom tóokër ba nag desewul kenn ku dul doomam ji mu sopp. Mu mujj koo yebal ca beykat ya te naan: “Sama doom, dinañu ko rus.” <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Teewul beykat ya ne ca seen biir: “Kii mooy donn; nanleen ko daldi rey, ndonoom di sunu moomeel.” <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Ñu jàpp ko, rey, génne néew ba tóokër ba, sànni ca biti.»<verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />«Ana nu boroom tóokër biy def? Xanaa dikk rekk, rey beykat yi, dénk tóokëru reseñ ba ñeneen. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Xanaa jànguleen gii kàddu ci Mbind mi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">“Doj wi tabaxkat yi beddi woon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">moo mujj di doju koñu tabax bi.<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Lii de, fa Boroom bi la sottee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:11">nu gis ko, yéemu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.10-11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Taalifi cant</char> 118.22-23.</note>.”»<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Ba loolu amee njiit ya di ko wuta jàpp, ndax xam nañu xéll ne ñoo moom léeb wa, waaye dañoo ragal mbooloo ma, ba tax ñu dem, bàyyi ko.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndax fey galag yoon la?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Njiiti Yawut ya teg ca yebal ca Yeesu ay <char style="w" lemma="Farisen y-:">Farisen</char> ak ay farandooy Buur Erodd, ngir ñu lalal ko fiir gu ñu ko jàppe ci kaw kàddu. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Ñooñu dikk ne ko: «Kilifa gi, xam nanu ne ku dëggu nga, te ragaloo kenn, ndax seetuloo ci jëmmi nit, waaye ci kaw dëgg ngay jàngalee yoonu Yàlla. Ndax yoon maye na ku fey Buur <char style="w" lemma="Sesaar:">Sesaar</char> ab galag, am déet? War nanu koo fey, am warunu koo fey?»<verse eid="MRK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Teewul Yeesu ràññee seen jinigal, ne leen: «Ana lu ngeen may seetloo? Indilleen ma posetub <char style="w" lemma="Xaalis:">dinaar</char>, ma xool.» <verse eid="MRK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Ñu jox ko poset, mu ne leen: «Nataal bii ak tur wii ci binde, kuy boroom?» Ñu ne ko: «Buur Sesaar.» <verse eid="MRK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Yeesu ne leen: «Yëfi Sesaar daal, joxleen ko Sesaar, yëfi Yàlla, ngeen jox ko Yàlla.» Ñu waaru nag ci moom.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sadusen gëmul dee-dekki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Sadusen y-:">Sadusen</char> yi ne dee-dekki amul, ñoo ñëwoon ci Yeesu, di ko laaj, ne ko: <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />«Kilifa gi, Musaa da noo bindal ne, ku góor, su ku mu bokkal waajur te amul doom, faatoo, su bàyyee gannaaw jabar, kooku na jël jabar ja, ngir amal mbokkam ma dee, kuutaay.<verse eid="MRK 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />«Léegi juróom ñaari góor ñu bokk ndey ak baay la woon. Taaw ba am jabar, ba faatu te bàyyiwul doom. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Tofo ba jël ndaw sa, ba mujj dee te bàyyiwul doom. Ñaareelu tofo ba it noonu. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Ñu topplantee ko noonu ba juróom ñaar ñépp dee, te kenn bàyyiwul doom. Gannaaw gi, ndaw sa it dee. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Keroog ndekkite la nag, bu ñu dekkee, kan ci ñoom la ndaw say doon jabaram, gannaaw juróom ñaar ñépp a ko jëloon jabar?»<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Yeesu ne leen: «Du lii mooy seen njuumte: xamuleen Mbind mi, xamuleen manoorey Yàlla! <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Ndax ñi dee, bu ñu dekkee, kenn du ci am jabar mbaa jëkkër, waaye dañuy mel ni malaaka yi ci asamaan. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Te ci wàllu dee-dekki sax, xanaa jànguleen na ko téereb Musaa indee ca mbirum ngarab sa, mooy ba mu ne: “Maay Yàllay Ibraayma, di Yàllay Isaaxa, di Yàllay <char style="w" lemma="Yanqóoba:">Yanqóoba</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Mucc ga</char> 3.6.</note>”? <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Kon moom du ñi dee lay seen Yàlla, xanaa ñiy dund. Njuumte lu réy ngeen juum.»<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndigal li gëna am solo ci yoonu Musaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Ci biir loolu ab firikatu yoonu Musaa bu dégg seen wax ja, daldi gis ne Yeesu tontu na leen bu baax. Mu dikk, laaj ko ne ko: «Ana lan ndigal moo gëna am solo ci ndigal yépp?»<verse eid="MRK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Yeesu ne ko: «Ndigal li gëna am solo mooy: “Dégluleen, yeen <char style="w" lemma="bànni Israayil:">bànni Israayil</char>, Boroom bi sunu Yàlla, Boroom bi kenn la. <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Kon seen Yàlla Boroom bi, nanga ko soppe sa léppi xol, ak sa léppi jëmm, ak sa léppi xel, ak sa léppi doole<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.29-30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Baamtug yoon wi</char> 6.4-5.</note>.” <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Ñaareel bi mooy: “Ni nga soppe sa bopp, nanga ko soppe sa moroom<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Sarxalkat yi</char> 19.18.</note>.” Ndigal gënula màgg yii.»<verse eid="MRK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Firikatu yoon bi ne ko: «Waawaaw, Kilifa gi, yaa wax dëgg; Yàlla kenn la, te amul jeneen Yàlla ju dul moom. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Te it nga soppe ko sa léppi xol, ak sa léppi xel, ak sa léppi doole, te ni nga soppe sa bopp, nanga ko soppe sa moroom; loolu moo gën mboolem <char style="w" lemma="Sarax yi:">saraxi dóomal</char>, ak yeneen sarax yu mu mana doon.»<verse eid="MRK 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Yeesu nag gis ne waa ja waxe xel, mu ne ko: «Sorewuloo nguurug Yàlla de.» Ba loolu amee kenn ñemeetu koo laaj dara.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Almasi bi sut na maamam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Yeesu nag di jàngale ca kër Yàlla ga, daldi laajte, ne: «Lu tax firikati yoon yi ne, <char style="w" lemma="Almasi b-:">Almasi</char> bi, sëtub <char style="w" lemma="Daawuda:">Daawuda</char> la? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Daawuda ci boppam moo waxe ci ni ko leeru <char style="w" lemma="Noo gu Sell g-:">Noo gu Sell</char> gi dikkale, ne:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">“Boroom bi daa wax sama Sang, ne ko:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">‘Toogeel sama ndijoor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">ba ma teg say noon fi sa suufu tànk<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Taalifi cant</char> 110.1.</note>.’ ”»<verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Yeesu neeti: «Gannaaw Daawuda ci boppam moo woowe Almasi bi “Sang bi,” ana kon nu mu nekke ab sëtam?» Mbooloo mu baree nga fa woon, di ko dégloo mbég.<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Yeesu teg ca xamal leen ne leen: «Moytuleen firikati yoonu Musaa yi taamoo jaagar-jaagareek seen mbubb yu réy, di sàkku nuyoob wegeel ca pénc ma, <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />ak toogu yu kaname ca jàngu ya, ak péetey teraanga ca bernde ya. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Ñooy saax-saaxee alalu jëtun ñi tey ñaan ñaani ngistal yu dul jeex. Ñooñu la seen mbugal di gëna tar.»<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yoolu sarax ca am-amu boroom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Ci kaw loolu Yeesu toog ca kër Yàlla ga, janook ndaa la ñuy dugal seen xaalis bu ñuy joxe ngir Yàlla. Muy seetlu na nit ñay dugalee xaalis ca ndaa la. Ay boroom alal yu bare dugal ca dayo yu takku. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Ci biir loolu ab jëtun dikk, sànni ca ñaari poseti xànjar<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.42 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">poseti xànjar: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">yooyu poset lepton lañu leen di woowe, te moo gënoona néew njarte ca yooya jamono. Seetal </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Xaalis </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ci Leeral yi.</char></note> yu matul sax ab dërëm.<verse eid="MRK 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Yeesu nag woo taalibe ya, ne leen: «Maa leen ko wax déy, mboolem ñi sànni xaalis ci ndab li, jëtun bu néew doole bii moo leen ëpple lu mu ci sànni. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Ndax ñoom ñépp ci seen koom lañu sàkke as lëf, sànni ci ndab li, waaye moom de, ci biirug ndóolam la jële la mu amoon lépp, dundam bépp, sànni ci.»<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Jéllub Yerusalem ak dellusig Almasi bi am nay takk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Naka la Yeesuy génne ca kër Yàlla ga, kenn ca taalibe ya ne ko: «Kilifa gi, xoolal rekk kër Yàlla gi! Céy yii doj ak yii taax!» <verse eid="MRK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Yeesu ne leen: «Gis ngeen yii taax yu réy yépp? Doj wu tege ciw doj du dese fii te tasul.»<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Gannaaw gi, ba Yeesu toogee ca kaw <char style="w" lemma="tundu Oliw y-:">tundu Oliw</char> ya, jàkkaarlook kër Yàlla ga, Piyeer ak Yanqóoba ak Yowaan ak Àndre ñoo dikk di ko laaj, ñook moom doŋŋ, ne ko: <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />«Wax nu kañ la loolu di am? Ak luy doonub takk buy xamle ne xew-xew yooyu yépp ay waaja sotti?»<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Yeesu ne leen: «Moytuleen, ba kenn du leen nax. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Ñu bareey dikk, tuddoo sama tur, naan: “Man a,” te ñu bare lañuy nax. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Bu ngeen déggee ay xare ak coowi xare, buleen tiit, fàww loolu am, waaye du doonagum muj ga. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Aw xeet dina jógal aw xeet, am réew jógal am réew, ay yëngu-yënguy suuf dina dikke fu bare, te ay xiif dina am, waaye ndoortel mititu mat la looluy doon.<verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />«Yeen nag moytuleen. Dees na leen jàpp, jébbal leen pénci layoo ya, dees na leen dóor ca biir jànguy Yawut ya, te fa kanam boroomi dëkk aki buur ngeen di taxawi ndax man, ngir ngeen man leena yékkatil kàdduy seede. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Balaa daraa xew, fàww xibaaru jàmm bi siiw ci xeet yépp. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Bu ñu leen tegee loxo nag, ba jébbal leen kilifa ya, la ngeen wara waxi bumu leen jaaxal, waaye kàddu gu ñu leen may keroog ca waxtu wa rekk, waxleen ko, ndax su keroogee du yeenay wax, waaye <char style="w" lemma="Noo gu Sell g-:">Noo gu Sell</char> geey wax ci yeen.<verse eid="MRK 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />«Doomu ndey dina wor doomu ndey, ngir ñu rey ko, baay it wore noonu doomam, te doom dina jógal waajuram, ba reylu ko. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Te it ñépp a leen di bañ ndax sama tur. Waaye ku muñ ba muj ga, kooku dina mucc.»<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />«Bés bu ngeen gisee nag “lu siblu luy jur yàqute”, mu taxawe fu mu yelloowul, yaw miy jàng, teewlul, su boobaa ña mu fekk ca diiwaanu Yude, nañu daw jëm kaw tund ya. <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />Ku mu fekk ci kaw am taax, bul wàcc, bay dugg jëli lenn ca biir. <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />Ku mu fekk tool ba, bul dellu ca kër ga, di jëli sa mbubb. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Wóoy ngalla jigéeni wérul ña, ak ñay nàmpal ca bés yooyu! <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Ñaanleen nag mu baña yemook jamonoy seddaayu lolli, <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />ndax janti keroog coono lay doon bu masula am, ba Yàllay doora sos àddina ba tey, te dootul am mukk. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Te bu Boroom bi wàññiwul woon àppu jant yooyu, kenn du mucc, waaye tànnéefam ñi mu tànn, ñoo tax mu wàññi janti coono ya.<verse eid="MRK 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />«Su booba nag, ku leen ne: “Xoolal, <char style="w" lemma="Almasi b-:">Almasi</char> baa ngi nii,” mbaa: “Xoolal, ma nga nee,” buleen ko gëm, <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />ndax ay almasiy caaxaan ak yonenti caaxaan ñooy feeñ, di jëfe ay firnde aki kéemaan, di wuta nax ñi ñu tànn, ndegam man naa nekk. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Yeen nag, moytuleen, wax naa leen lépp, ba noppi.»<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />Yeesu neeti: «Te fan yooya, gannaaw coono ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:24">“jant bi day lëndëm,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:24">weer wi fey ag leeram,<verse eid="MRK 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />biddiiw yi xàwweekoo asamaan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:25">doole ya fa asamaan sàqi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.24-25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Esayi</char> 3.10; 34.4; <char style="bk">Yowel</char> 2.10.</note>.”<verse eid="MRK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />«Su boobaa dees na gis <char style="w" lemma="Doomu nit k-:">Doomu nit</char> kiy ñëw ci ay niir, ànd ak manoore ju réy ak daraja. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Su ko defee mu yebal malaaka yi, ñu dajalee ay tànnéefam fa ñeenti jëmuy ngelaw li, dale ko ca catu kaw suuf, ba ca catu asamaan.»<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />Yeesu teg ca ne: «Jàngatleen misaalu garabu figg. Ag figg, bu bànqaas ya duyee, xob ya di sëq, ngeen xam ne nawet jubsi na. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Bu ngeen gisee xew-xew yooyu sotti, noonu itam ngeen di xame ne bés bi jubsi na, ba agsi ci bunt bi sax. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Maa leen ko wax déy, niti tey jii<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.30 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">niti tey jii: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Màrk</char> 8.38. </note> duñu wéy mukk, te loolu lépp sottiwul. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Asamaan ak suuf dina wees, waaye samay wax du wees mukk.<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yàlla rekk a xam bés ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />«Waaye bés boobu mbaa waxtu wa nag, kenn xamu ko; du malaaka ya fa asamaan, du Doom ji, xanaa Baay bi doŋŋ. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Moytuleen te teewlu, ndax xamuleen kañ la. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Daa mel ni nit ku tukki, bàyyi këram gannaaw. Fekk na mu batale ay surgaam, ku nekk ak saw sas. Bëkk-néeg bi nag, mu sant ko ne ko mu teewlu. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Kon teewluleen, ndax xamuleen kañ la boroom kër giy dikk. Jombul muy ngoonug suuf, mbaa xaaju guddi, mbaa bu ganaar sabee, mbaa bu bët setee. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Bumu ne jalañ, fekk leen ciy nelaw. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Lii ma leen wax nag, ñépp laa ko wax: “Teewluleen!”»<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Njiiti yoon yi fexeel nañu Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Màggal yi:">Màggalu bésub Mucc</char> ba ak <char style="w" lemma="Màggal yi:">màggalug ayu bésu Mburu mu amul lawiir</char> a jubsi woon, ba des ñaari fan. Ci kaw loolu <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">sarxalkat</char> yu mag ya ak firikati yoonu Musaa ya di wut nu ñu sàcce ba jàpp Yeesu, reylu ko. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Ndax booba dañu ne: «Bumu doon ci bésu màggal bi, lu ko moy askan wi yëngu.»<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">As ndaw sotti na lajkoloñ ci kaw Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Ci biir loolu Yeesu demoon na dëkk ba ñuy wax Betani. Mu dale kër ku ñuy wax Simoŋ <char style="w" lemma="gaana:">gaana</char> ga. As ndaw dikk, fekk ko muy lekk. Ndaw saa nga yor njaqal doju albatar lu def diwu nàrd gu xeeñ lu neex te raxul, tey jar lu baree bare. Mu toj njaq li, daldi sotti diw gi ci boppu Yeesu.<verse eid="MRK 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Ñenn ca ña mu fa fekk nag ñaawlu loolu. Ñuy xultu ci seen biir naan: «Ana lu waral yàq gii lajkoloñ? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Gii diw maneesoon na koo jaaye lu tollook ñetti téeméeri poseti xaalis<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.5 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">poseti xaalis </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mooy peyooru benn bésub liggéey ca jamono yooya.</char></note>, jox ko néew-doole yi.» Ñu sikk ca ndaw sa lool.<verse eid="MRK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Yeesu nag ne leen: «Bàyyileen ndaw si, ana lu ngeen koy sonale? Jëf ju rafet la ma defal. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Néew-doole yi de, dingeen ci am ñu nekk ak yeen ba fàww, te saa yu leen neexee, man ngeen leena defal lu baax. Waaye man de, amuleen ma ba fàww. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Ndaw si, li mu man, def na ko. Laata ñu may rob, diw na ma lu xeeñ. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Te maa leen ko wax déy, li ndaw sii def, fépp fu ñuy yéeneji ëllëg xibaaru jàmm bi ci àddina sépp, dees na ko fa nettalee, di ko fàttalikoo jëmmu ndaw si.»<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda wor na Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Ci biir loolu kenn ca Fukk ñaak ñaar, ñu di ko wax Yuda Iskaryo, daldi dem ca <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">sarxalkat</char> yu mag ya, ngir teg Yeesu ci seeni loxo. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Ba sarxalkat yu mag ya déggee lu doon tànki Yuda Iskaryo, dañu caa bég, ba dig ko xaalis. Muy seet nag yoon wu mu jekkoo Yeesu, ba wor ko.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu bokk na reeram bu mujj aki taalibeem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Ca bés ba njëkk ca <char style="w" lemma="Màggal yi:">màggalug ayu bésu Mburu mu amul lawiir</char>, ñu war caa rendi gàttub <char style="w" lemma="Màggal yi:">bésub Mucc</char>, ca la taalibe ya laaj Yeesu, ne ko: «Foo bëgg, nu dem, waajalal la fa reeru bésub Mucc bi?» <verse eid="MRK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Yeesu nag yebal ñaar ca taalibe ya, ne leen: «Demleen ca dëkk ba, dina am waa ju dajeek yeen. Ma nga yenu njaqas ndox, toppleen ko. <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />Kër gu mu mana dugg, neleen boroom kër ga: “Kilifa gi nee: Ana néegu gan, fi may reere reeru bésub Mucc, maak samay taalibe?” <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Kooku moo leen di won néegub kaw bu yaa, bu ñu defar ba mu jekk. Foofa ngeen nuy waajale.» <verse eid="MRK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Ba taalibe ya demee ba àgg ca biir dëkk ba it, noonu lañu gise la mu leen waxoon. Ñu daldi waajal reeru bésub Mucc ba.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Ba jant sowee, Yeesu dikk, ànd ak Fukk ñaak ñaar. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Gannaaw ba ñu toogee bay reer, Yeesu ne leen: «Maa leen ko wax déy, kenn ci yeen ñiy lekkandoo ak man, moo may wor.» <verse eid="MRK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Aw tiis nag jàpp taalibe ya, ñu kenn-kennoo di laaj, naan: «Mbaa du man?» <verse eid="MRK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Mu ne leen: «Yeen Fukk ak ñaar ñii daal, kenn la ci, te mu ngi yebandoo ak man loxoom ci ndab li. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" /><char style="w" lemma="Doomu nit k-:">Doomu nit</char> kaa ngi dem moos, noonee ñu ko binde woon, waaye wóoy ngalla ki pexe mi ñu wore Doomu nit ki di jaare! Kooka de, bañoona juddu sax moo doon gën ci moom.»<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Naka ñuy lekk, Yeesu jël mburu, yékkati kàddug cant, dagg, jox leen, daldi ne: «Jëlleen, lii sama yaram la.» <verse eid="MRK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Mu teg ca jël ab kaas, yékkati kàddug cant, jox leen, ñépp naan ca. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Mu ne leen: «Lii mooy sama deret, ji fas <char style="w" lemma="kóllëre g-:">kóllëre</char> gi, te nara tuurul ñépp<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Esayi 53.12</char> ak ci <char style="bk">1.Timote</char> 2.6.</note>. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Maa leen ko wax déy, dootuma naan mukk ndoxum reseñ, ba kera ma naan ko bees ca nguurug Yàlla.»<verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Ba loolu amee ñu yékkati galanu cant, daldi génn jëm <char style="w" lemma="tundu Oliw y-:">tundu Oliw</char> ya.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu nee Piyeer dina jàmbu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Yeesu nag ne leen: «Yeen ñépp ay dellu gannaaw, ndax bindees na ne:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 14:27">“Maay dóor sàmm bi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 14:27">xar yi tasaaroo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Sàkkaryaa</char> 13.7.</note>.”<verse eid="MRK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Waaye bu ma dekkee, dinaa leen jiituji fa Galile.»<verse eid="MRK 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Piyeer nag ne ko: «Bu ñépp dellu woon gannaaw it, man duma dellu gannaaw mukk.» <verse eid="MRK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Yeesu ne ko: «Maa la ko wax déy, yaw, guddig tey jii, bala ganaar a sab ñaari yoon, dinga ma jàmbu ñetti yoon.» <verse eid="MRK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Piyeer nag gënatee biral, ne: «Su ma naree ànd ak yaw dee sax déy, duma la jàmbu mukk.» Taalibe ya ca des yépp nag waxe noonu, ñoom itam.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu tiislu na ca toolu Setsemane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Ñu dem ba tollook tool ba ñu dippee Setsemane. Yeesu ne taalibe ya: «Toogleen fii, xaar ma, ma ñaani.» <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Ci kaw loolu mu ànd ak Piyeer ak Yanqóoba ak Yowaan. Tiitaange ak njàqare daldi koy jàpp. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Mu ne leen: «Tiis wuy rey la sama xol fees, ba may bëgga dee! Toogleen fii te ngeen teewlu.»<verse eid="MRK 14:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Ba loolu amee Yeesu dox ba sore leen tuuti, ne gurub sukk, dëpp jëëm fa suuf, di ñaan ngir, ndegam man naa am, coonob waxtu wa mu dëgmal teggi ko. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Mu ne: «Abba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.36 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Abba </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mu ngi tekki baay.</char></note>, Baay, yaw mi dara tëwul, bii kaas bu fees ak wextanu coono, ngalla teggil ma ko. Waaye bumuy sama coobare, nay doon ci sa coobare.»<verse eid="MRK 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Gannaaw loolu mu délsi, fekk taalibe ya di nelaw. Mu ne Piyeer: «Simoŋ, dangay nelaw? Wenn waxtu doŋŋ, amuloo dooley teewlu ko? <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Teewluleen te ñaan, ngir baña tàbbi cig fiir. Xolub nit kat yebu na, yaram see néew doole.» <verse eid="MRK 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Yeesu demaat ba nee, daldi baamtu kàddug ñaanam ga. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Mu délsiwaat, fekk leen ñuy nelaw, manatuñoo xippi ndax ngëmment lu réy. Xamuñu nag lu ñuy wax.<verse eid="MRK 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Gannaaw loolu mu délsiwaat ñetteel bi yoon, daldi ne leen: «Yeena ngi nelaw, di noppalu ba tey? Jeex na nag. Waxtu wi dikk na. Ñu ngi nii di teg <char style="w" lemma="Doomu nit k-:">Doomu nit</char> ki ci loxoy bàkkaarkat yi. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Jógleen, nu dem. Ki may wor a ngi nii.»<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jàpp nañu Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Naka la Yeesu di wax, daaneelagul, Yuda, kenn ca Fukk ñaak ñaar dikk, ànd ak gàngoor gu bawoo ca <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">sarxalkat</char> yu mag yaak firikati yoonu Musaa yaak magi askan wa. Ña nga gànnaayoo ay saamar aki njur.<verse eid="MRK 14:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Fekk na workat ba tegtal leen, ne leen: «Ki may fóon, kooku la; jàppleen ko, yóbbu te wattu ko bu baax.» <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Mu daldi agsi, dikk ba ci Yeesu, ne ko: «Kilifa gi!», daldi ko fóon. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Ba mu ko defee nit ña ne ko taral, jàpp ko. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Ba loolu amee kenn ca ña fa taxaw bocci ab saamar, caw ko surgab sarxalkat bu mag ba, njoof nopp ba.<verse eid="MRK 14:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Yeesu ne leen: «Jàppsi ma doŋŋ a leen taxa dikkey saamar aki njur, mel ni ñuy topp ab fippukat? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Moona bés bu nekk maa nga woon ak yeen ca kër Yàlla ga, di jàngale, te jàppuleen ma. Waaye lii daa am ngir sottal Mbind mi.» <verse eid="MRK 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Ci kaw loolu, ñépp daw, wacc ko.<verse eid="MRK 14:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Ab xale bu góor a nga ko toppoon, lëkkaayoo ab malaan kese. Ñu daldi ko jàpp. <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />Xale bu góor ba nag, ne wëqét, daw, wacc fa malaan ma, def yaramu neen.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu taxaw na ca kuréelu àttekat ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Ba loolu amee ñu yóbbu Yeesu ca <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">sarxalkat</char> bu mag ba, yeneen sarxalkat yu mag yaak magi askan waak firikati yoonu Musaa ya, ñépp daje fa. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Ci biir loolu Piyeer yoxal Yeesu lu sore, topp ca gannaawam, ba ca biir ëttu sarxalkat bu mag ba. Mu toog faak wattukat ya, di jaaru ca taal ba.<verse eid="MRK 14:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Ci kaw loolu sarxalkat yu mag yaak mboolem <char style="w" lemma="kuréelu àttekat y-:">kuréelu àttekati</char> Yawut ya di wut kàddug seede gu ñu tuumaale Yeesu, ba ñu man koo reylu, te amuñu ko. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Teewul ñu baree dikk, seedeel Yeesu ay fen, waaye seen kàddu yaa woroo. <verse eid="MRK 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Ci biir loolu ñenn ña jóg, seedeel ko ay fen, daldi ne: <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />«Nun de dégg nanu, mu ne: “Kër Yàlla gii loxol nit liggéey, maa koy toj, tabaxaat ci ñetti fan geneen kër Yàlla gu loxol nit liggéeyul<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.58 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Yowaan</char> 2.19-22.</note>.”» <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Kàdduy ñooña nag woroo ba tey.<verse eid="MRK 14:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Ba mu ko defee sarxalkat bu mag ba jóg taxaw ca digg mbooloo ma. Mu ne Yeesu: «Doo tontu dara ci li la ñii tuumaal?» <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Yeesu ne cell, waxul dara. Sarxalkat bu mag ba dellu ne ko: «Ndax yaa di <char style="w" lemma="Almasi b-:">Almasi</char> bi, Doomu Ki yelloo màggal?» <verse eid="MRK 14:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Yeesu ne ko: «Man mii la, te dingeen gis <char style="w" lemma="Doomu nit k-:">Doomu nit</char> ki toog ci ndijooru Boroom Kàttan gi, dingeen ko gis itam ci biir niir yi, muy ñëw<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.62 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Dañeel</char> 7.13.</note>.»<verse eid="MRK 14:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Sarxalkat bu mag nag ne tareet yérey boppam<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.63 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">tareet yére: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">màndargaam ténj la, ma ñu tere sarxalkat yu mag ya. Fii, jëf jooja day màndargaal ci seen cosaan ne Yeesu dañu ko wara teg daan.</char></note>, daldi ne: «Ana lu nuy doyeeti ay seede? <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Yeena dégg ni mu diire Yàlla mbagg! Lu ngeen ci xam nag?» Ñépp ne dee mooy àtteem. <verse eid="MRK 14:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Ci kaw loolu ñenn ña tàmbali koo tifli, muur kanam gi, dóor ko ay këmëx, naan ko: «Yaw waxal nu kàdduy <char style="w" lemma="waxyu:">waxyu</char> boog!» Wattukat yi daldi ko jàpp, dóor ko ay mbej.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Piyeer jàmbu na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Ci biir loolu Piyeer a nga woon ca suuf, ca ëtt ba. Benn surga bu jigéen bu <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">sarxalkat</char> bu mag ba romb fa. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Naka la gis Piyeer muy jaaru, mu xool ko jàkk, ne ko: «Yaw itam yaak Yeesum Nasaret a àndoon.» <verse eid="MRK 14:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Piyeer nag miim ko, ne ko: «Man de, yéguma, xawma dara ci li ngay wax.» Piyeer daldi génn, ba ca mbaaru bunt ba ca biti. <verse eid="MRK 14:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Surga bu jigéen ba gisati ko dellu ne ña fa taxaw: «Kii ci ñoom la bokk!» <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Mu dellu miim ko.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:70">Nes tuut ña fa taxaw ñoom it, ne Piyeer: «Yaw itam kay ci ñoom nga bokk, nde yaw itam waa Galile nga.» <verse eid="MRK 14:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Piyeer di tàmbalee waat aka giñ ne: «Ki ngeen di wax, man xawma ko!» <verse eid="MRK 14:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Ca saa sa ganaar sab ñaareel bi yoon. Piyeer nag fàttaliku la ko Yeesu waxoon, ne ko: «Bala ganaar a sab ñaari yoon, dinga ma jàmbu ñetti yoon.» Mu ne yikkét, jooy.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Yeesu taxaw na ca kanam Pilaat, boroom réew ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Ca ëllëg sa, suba teel <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">sarxalkat</char> yu mag ya féncoo, ñoom ak magi askan wa ak firikati yoonu Musaa ya, ak mboolem <char style="w" lemma="kuréelu àttekat y-:">kuréelu àttekatu</char> Yawut ya. Ñu yeew Yeesu, yóbbu ko, jébbal ko <char style="w" lemma="Pilaat:">Pilaat</char>.<verse eid="MRK 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Pilaat nag laaj ko, ne ko: «Yaw yaa di buurub Yawut yi?» Yeesu ne ko: «Yaa ko wax.» <verse eid="MRK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Sarxalkat yu mag yi nag tuumaal ko lu bare. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Pilaat dellu ko laaj, ne ko: «Doo tontu dara? Déggal li ñu lay jiiñ lépp.» <verse eid="MRK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Yeesu nag tontuwul dara, ba tax Pilaat jaaxle.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Fekk na màggal gu nekkaan, Pilaat daan na maye ca ña ñu tëj kaso, kenn nit ku ñu sàkku, mu bàyyil leen kooka. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Fekk na ñu tëj ca kaso ba, ku ñuy wax Barabas, mook ay fippukat yu bóomoon nit ci ab yëngu-yëngal. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Ci kaw loolu mbooloo ma dikk, di sàkku Pilaat defal leen la mu leen daan defal. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Pilaat ne leen: «Lu ngeen bëgg? Ma bàyyi buurub Yawut yi?» <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Booba xam na xéll ne kiñaan a tax sarxalkat yu mag ya jàpplu Yeesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Waaye sarxalkat yu mag ya ñaax mbooloo ma ba ñu ne Pilaat: «Yiwil nu Barabas.»<verse eid="MRK 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Pilaat dellu ne leen: «Lu ngeen bëgg nag, ma def ko kii ngeen di wax buurub Yawut yi?» <verse eid="MRK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Ñu dellu xaacoondoo ca kaw, ne: «Daaj ko ci bant!» <verse eid="MRK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Pilaat ne leen: «Lu tax? Ana lu bon lu mu def?» Mbooloo ma gëna xaacooti, ne: «Daaj ko ci bant!» <verse eid="MRK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Pilaat nag bëgg lu neex mbooloo ma, ba tax mu bàyyi Barabas. Mu cawlu Yeesu ay kàcciri, ba noppi teg ko ciy loxo, ngir ñu daaj ko ci bant.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ñaawal nañu Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Takk-deri Room ya nag dugal Yeesu ca ëttu kër boroom réew wa, daldi woo gàngoor ga gépp, <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />ñu solal ko mbubb mu xonq curr, teg ci boppam <char style="w" lemma="kaala g-:">kaala</char> gu ñu ràbbe ay dég. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Ña nga koy nuyu, naan: «Buuru Yawut yée, guddaluw fan!» <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />di ko dóor aw yet ci bopp, di ko tifli, di ko sukkal. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Ba ñu ko ñaawalee ba noppi, dañoo summi mbubb mu xonq ma, solal ko ay yéreem, door koo yóbbu, ngir ñu daaj ko ci bant.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rey nañu Yeesu ca kaw bant ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Ci biir loolu jenn waay ju ñuy wax Simoŋ, dëkke fu ñu naan Siren<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.21 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Siren, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ab dëkk la bu nekkoon ci tefesu bëj-gànnaaru Afrig te féete Misra sowu.</char></note> jóge ca tool ya, jaare fa. Muy baayu Alegsàndar ak Rufus. Moom lañu gàdduloo bant ba. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Ñu yóbbu Yeesu ca béreb ba ñuy wax Golgota, muy firi bérebu Kaaŋu bopp<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.22 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">bérebu Kaaŋu bopp </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mooy tund wu nirook kaaŋu bopp.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Ñu bëgg koo nàndale biiñ bu ñu jaxaseek safal bu ñuy wax miir, mu bañ.<verse eid="MRK 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Ba mu ko defee ñu daaj Yeesu ca bant ba, ba noppi séddoo ay yéreem, tegoo ko bant, ngir xam lu ca ku nekk di am. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Ca yoor-yoor lañu daaj Yeesu ci bant, yemook juróom ñeenti waxtu. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Lii lañu bind ne moo di tuumaam ja ko daanlu: «Kii mooy Buurub Yawut yi.» <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27-28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27-28" />Ñaari fippukat lañu daajaaleek Yeesu ci ay bant, kenn ki ci ndijooram, ki ci des ci càmmoñam.<verse eid="MRK 15:27-28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Ña fa jaare nag di ko saaga, aka wëcc bopp, naan: «Acam, yaw miy toj kër Yàlla gi, tabaxaat ko ci ñetti fan, <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />wàccal bant bi, musal sa bopp boog!» <verse eid="MRK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" /><char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">Sarxalkat</char> yu mag ya it naka noonu, ñook firikati yoonu Musaa ya. Ñu di ko ñaawal ci seen biir, naan: «Moom day musle te manul musal sax boppam. <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Na <char style="w" lemma="Almasi b-:">Almasi</char> bi, buurub Israayil wàcc bant bi léegi, nu gis ba gëm.» Ci biir loolu ña ñu daajaale ak moom itam di ko tifaare ay saaga.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu faatu na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Ba fukki waxtu ak ñaar ca bëccëg jotee, ag lëndëm a wàcc ca réew ma mépp, ba fukki waxtu ak juróom ca ngoon. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Ba fukki waxtu ak juróom ca ngoon jotee, Yeesu àddu ca kaw, ne: «Elowi, Elowi, lema sabaktani?» muy firi: «Sama Yàlla, sama Yàlla, lu tax nga wacc ma?» <verse eid="MRK 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Ñenn ca ña ko teewe, dégg ca, ne: «Déggal, Yonent Yàlla <char style="w" lemma="Ilyaas:">Ilyaas</char> lay woo.» <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Mu am ku daw, jël ab sagar, xooj ko ci bineegar, lonk ko ci bant, tàllal ko ko, ngir mu naan, te ne: «Bàyyileen, nu seet, ndax Ilyaas ay ñëw, wàcce ko.» <verse eid="MRK 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Yeesu nag yuuxu, daldi dog.<verse eid="MRK 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Ba mu ko defee ridob biir néegu Yàlla ba xar ñaar, dale ca kaw ba ca suuf. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" /><char style="w" lemma="njiitu takk-der b-:">Njiitu takk-der</char> ba taxawoon ca kanam Yeesu nag gis, na Yeesu doge. Mu ne: «Aylayéwén, waa jii mooy <char style="w" lemma="Doomu Yàlla j-:">Doomu Yàlla</char>!»<verse eid="MRK 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Ay jigéen a nga fa woon, dànd leen lu sore, di seetaan. Maryaama ma dëkk Magdala ca la bokk, ak Maryaama yaayu Yanqóoba mu ndaw ak Yose, ak ndaw seneen su ñuy wax Salome. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Ba Yeesu nekkee Galile, jigéen ñooñoo ko toppoon, di ko toppatoo. Ñeneen jigéen ñu baree nga ca woon, di ñu àndoon ak Yeesu, ba dikk Yerusalem.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rob nañu Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Loolu lépp bésub Waajal ba la xewe, ëllëg sa di bésub Noflaay. Ca ngoon sa, <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />ku ñuy wax Yuusufa te dëkk Arimate, daldi takk aw fitam, dem ca <char style="w" lemma="Pilaat:">Pilaat</char>, sàkku ci moom, mu jox ko néewub Yeesu. Yuusufa moomu, ku ñu nawloo la woon ca <char style="w" lemma="kuréelu àttekat y-:">kuréelu àttekati</char> Yawut ya. Bokkoon na moom itam ca ña doon séentu nguurug Yàlla. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Ba Pilaat déggee ne Yeesu faatu na xaat, am na mbetteel. Mu woolu nag <char style="w" lemma="njiitu takk-der b-:">njiitu takk-der</char> ya, laaj ko, ndax yàgg naa faatu. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Bi ko njiit la waxee, Pilaat may Yuusufa mu jël néew ba.<verse eid="MRK 15:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Fekk na Yuusufa jënd càngaayal lẽe. Mu wàcce néew ba, sàng ko ca, denc ko ci <char style="w" lemma="bàmmeel b-:">bàmmeel</char> bu ñu yatt ciw doj. Ba mu ko defee Yuusufa béraŋ aw doj, ube ko buntu bàmmeel ba. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Ci biir loolu Maryaama ma dëkk Magdala, ak Maryaama yaayu Yose ña ngay xool fa ñu denc néew ba.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Yeesu Almasi bi dekki na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Ba <char style="w" lemma="bésub Noflaay b-:">bésub Noflaay</char> ba wéyee, Maryaamam Magdala ak Maryaama yaayu Yanqóoba ñoo ànd ak Salome jëndi diw gu xeeñ, ngir diwe ko néewub Yeesu. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Ba njël jotee, yemook bésub dibéer, ba jiitu ca ayu bésu Yawut ya, ñu xëy ca <char style="w" lemma="bàmmeel b-:">bàmmeel</char> ba. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Ña nga naa ca seen biir: «Ku nuy béraŋal doj, wi ub buntu bàmmeel bi?»<verse eid="MRK 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Naka lañu ne siggét rekk, ñu gis ne doj wa béraŋu na ba lafu. Te doj wu réy lool la woon. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Ñu dugg ca biir bàmmeel ba, daldi gis xalelu góor bu tooge wetu ndijoor, sol mbubb mu weex tàll. Ñu tiit lool. <verse eid="MRK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Mu ne leen: «Buleen tiit. Yeesum Nasaret, mi ñu daajoon ci bant, mi ngeen di seet, dekki na. Nekku fi. Fii lañu ko tëraloon. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Demleen nag wax ay taalibeem, ñook Piyeer, ne leen Yeesu jiituji na leen Galile. Foofa ngeen koy gise, na mu leen ko waxe woon.»<verse eid="MRK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Ba loolu amee jigéen ña génn bàmmeel ba, daw, di lox te yéemu. Waxuñu kenn dara nag ndax tiitaange<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Màrk moom fii la yem; li ci des, keneen moo ko nettali.</char></note>.<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu feeñu na ay taalibeem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Gannaaw ba Yeesu dekkee ca subag dibéer ga, ndoortel ayu bés ba, Maryaamam Magdala ma mu dàqaloon juróom ñaari rab, moom la njëkka feeñu. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Maryaama nag àggeji ko àndandooy Yeesu ya, fekk ñuy naqarlu, di jooy. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Ba leen Maryaama nee Yeesoo ngi dund, te gis na Yeesu, gëmuñu ko.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Gannaaw loolu ñaar ca ñoom la Yeesu feeñoo jeneen jëmm, fekk leen ci yoon wu jëm àll ba. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Ñu waññiku, wax ko ña ca des, waaye ñoom it gëmuñu leen.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Gannaaw ga, Yeesu feeñu na fukki taalibe yaak benn, fekk leen ñuy lekk. Mu yedd leen ndax seen ngëmadi ak seenug të, ngir la ñu gëmul ña ko njëkka gis, gannaaw ba mu dekkee. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Mu ne leen: «Demleen ci àddina sépp, ngeen àgge nit ñépp xibaaru jàmm bii. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Ku gëm, te ñu sóob ko ci ndox, dina mucc; ku gëmul, dees na ko teg daan. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Ñi gëm nag yii firnde lañuy àndal: dinañu dàq ay rab ci sama tur, dinañu làkk làkk yu bees; <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />dinañu jàppe seeni loxo ay jaan; bu ñu naanee tooke buy rey bu mu mana doon, du leen wàññi dara; te dinañu <char style="w" lemma="teg loxo:">teg jarag ji loxo</char>, ñu wér.»<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Gannaaw ba Sang bi Yeesu waxee ak ñoom, ñu yéege ko asamaan, mu toog ci ndijooru Yàlla. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Taalibe ya nag di waareji fépp, Sang bi ànd ak ñoom di liggéey, tey dëggale kàddu ga, firnde ya kàddu ga àndal.<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>